01:12:58.620 --> 01:13:00.620
DA Undersecretary Asis G. Perez: and targeted intervention

asr-000489
01:13:00.620 --> 01:13:02.620
DA Undersecretary Asis G. Perez: as such as appropriate

asr-000490
01:13:02.620 --> 01:13:04.620
DA Undersecretary Asis G. Perez: least scaled machinery.

