Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ITA people

asr-001329
02:09:05.200 --> 02:09:07.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: po ang maaari pong mawala ng

asr-001330
02:09:07.080 --> 02:09:08.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lupa, ng kabuhayan

asr-001331
02:09:08.800 --> 02:09:11.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kanilang mga ancestral

asr-001332
02:09:11.160 --> 02:09:12.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lands dahil po sa

asr-001333
02:09:12.860 --> 02:09:15.820
