asr-001334
02:09:17.240 --> 02:09:18.780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa ngayon, Mr. Chair,

asr-001335
02:09:19.060 --> 02:09:20.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ina-assess pa namin mabuti

asr-001336
02:09:20.800 --> 02:09:22.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kung ano yung full effects ng

asr-001337
02:09:22.680 --> 02:09:24.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pax Silica

asr-001338
02:09:24.200 --> 02:09:27.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: but initial reports na nakikita

asr-001339
02:09:27.260 --> 02:09:27.820
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ko is

asr-001340
02:09:27.820 --> 02:09:30.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: hindi ganun karami yung

asr-001341
02:09:30.760 --> 02:09:31.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ma-affect

asr-001342
02:09:31.920 --> 02:09:34.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: not 15,000 hectares

asr-001343
