DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ng 1,600

asr-001353
02:09:55.000 --> 02:09:58.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: mukhang hindi naman ganun karami

asr-001354
