asr-001360
02:10:10.000 --> 02:10:11.900
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kung ano yung full effects sa agriculture.

asr-001361
02:10:12.220 --> 02:10:13.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, nagbigay na bang DA

asr-001362
02:10:13.740 --> 02:10:16.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng Certificate of Eligibility

asr-001363
