Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for Reclassification of Agricultural Lands

asr-001364
02:10:18.440 --> 02:10:20.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa area na sasaklawin ng Pax Silica

asr-001365
