DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: it's not DA

asr-001378
02:10:45.800 --> 02:10:47.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yan ang alam namin, Mr. Chair.

asr-001379
