Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailan mo matatapos

asr-001380
02:10:49.640 --> 02:10:51.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung ginagawa nyo ngayon na assessment

asr-001381
02:10:51.380 --> 02:10:53.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa mga napaulat na maapektuhan

asr-001382
02:10:53.160 --> 02:10:54.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga magsasaka?

asr-001383
02:10:54.400 --> 02:10:56.720
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Siguro another 30 days, Mr. Chair.

asr-001384
02:10:57.740 --> 02:10:58.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, sana po dahil

asr-001385
02:10:58.980 --> 02:11:00.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: isa itong malaking usapin

asr-001386
02:11:00.360 --> 02:11:02.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: matapos ito bago yung

asr-001387
02:11:02.500 --> 02:11:04.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: plenary deliberation ng DA budget

asr-001388
02:11:04.840 --> 02:11:06.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: naniniwala po tayo na ang development

asr-001389
02:11:06.900 --> 02:11:09.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi dapat mga hulugan ng pagsasakripisyo

asr-001390
02:11:09.180 --> 02:11:10.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kakayahan ng bansa natin

asr-001391
02:11:10.860 --> 02:11:13.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mag-produce ng sarili nating pagkain.

