asr-002422
02:59:54.070 --> 02:59:56.330
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: when it comes to the statutory

asr-002423
02:59:56.330 --> 02:59:57.690
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: requirements. Of course, yung sa

asr-002424
02:59:57.690 --> 02:59:59.870
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: DANR, NCIP, yung mga ROA.

asr-002425
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:11.740
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: And then lastly, we also incorporate may mas mataas po ang weight, may points din po when it is in the GEDA or yung geographically isolated and disadvantaged areas po.

asr-002426
03:00:11.940 --> 03:00:19.160
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: And recently, of course, with the drought incidences, we also incorporated it for the prioritization process.

asr-002427
03:00:19.500 --> 03:00:20.620
NIA Project Planning Division Manager Robert Mark Revillame: Mr. Chair, salamat po.

asr-002428
03:00:20.780 --> 03:00:21.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002429
03:00:21.840 --> 03:00:29.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sir, alam niyo po, pag pinakikinggan ko explanation, dapat kung susundin lang yung master plan, lahat ng irrigable land, meron ng irigasyon eh.

asr-002430
03:00:30.920 --> 03:00:41.750
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam niyo po, 1963 pa, itinayo yung NIA, kalahating siglo na, hindi pa rin na bibigyan ng irigasyon yung mga lugar na dapat bigyan ng irigasyon.

asr-002431
03:00:42.230 --> 03:00:46.350
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam niyo po kung anong sinasabi, minumura po ng mga magsasaka yung NIA sa ground.

asr-002432
03:00:48.090 --> 03:00:50.250
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Magtatayo kayo ng irigasyon, wala naman tubig.

asr-002433
03:00:51.430 --> 03:00:53.110
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Doon sa may sobrang tubig.

asr-002434
03:00:53.150 --> 03:01:00.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi naman kayo gagawa ng proyekto para ma-maximize yung sobrang tubig, administrator.

asr-002435
03:01:01.260 --> 03:01:08.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, kalahating siglo na ito, Mr. Chair, ang NIA, pinupunto ko po dito, paulit-ulit na lang na problema, yung irigasyon.

asr-002436
03:01:09.900 --> 03:01:14.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tapos, sasabihin tayo, meron namang master plan, eh kailan pa matatapos yung master plan na yan?

asr-002437
03:01:14.760 --> 03:01:16.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Patay na lahat ng magsasaka, wala pa rin irigasyon.

asr-002438
03:01:18.260 --> 03:01:21.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, papaano po ang plano ng NIA para tupdin?

asr-002439
03:01:21.860 --> 03:01:25.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero yun yung every year, 1% po ang naidadagdag. Tama po ba?

asr-002440
03:01:25.460 --> 03:01:28.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Eh napakababa nun, Mr. Chair, abutin tayo kupong-kupong dito.

asr-002441
03:01:28.680 --> 03:01:31.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi pa ako buhay, problema na ng ano yan, mga magsasaka yan eh.

asr-002442
03:01:31.940 --> 03:01:35.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Eh baka tumanda na ako at lahat dito, hindi pa rin matatapos yung problema ng irigasyon.

asr-002443
03:01:35.820 --> 03:01:37.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Anong plano ng NIA, Mr. Chair?

asr-002444
03:01:37.060 --> 03:01:37.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Admin, please answer.

asr-002445
03:01:38.260 --> 03:01:39.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002446
03:01:39.220 --> 03:01:46.020
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya nga po, napansin nyo sa aming proposal kanina, para sana mayangat natin ng malaki ang ating cover aids,

asr-002447
03:01:46.460 --> 03:01:51.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ay 250 billion mahigit ang budget na nire-request po natin, Mr. Chair.

asr-002448
03:01:51.360 --> 03:01:54.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya lang, dahil sa fiscal limitation,

asr-002449
03:01:55.460 --> 03:01:57.700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: kaya lang tayo ng 46 billion.

asr-002450
03:01:57.860 --> 03:01:59.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So kailangan po natin doon pagkasyahin.

asr-002451
03:02:00.240 --> 03:02:05.260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At kung napansin po ninyo, Mr. Chair, sinabit naman namin yung aming budget proposal,

asr-002452
03:02:06.080 --> 03:02:08.620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: karamihan po doon, ongoing, tier 1.

asr-002453
03:02:09.440 --> 03:02:12.700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi po kami makakapagpasok halos ng bagong mga projects.

asr-002454
03:02:12.900 --> 03:02:16.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya tinatapos lamang po ng NIA yung mga ongoing projects po natin.

asr-002455
03:02:17.540 --> 03:02:21.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So kami naman po ay matindi po ang aming kriteria ngayon.

asr-002456
03:02:21.880 --> 03:02:25.020
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ano po? Bago namin ponduhan ang isang project.

asr-002457
03:02:25.460 --> 03:02:28.400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan sumunod siya doon sa aming kriteriya.

asr-002458
03:02:29.320 --> 03:02:31.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Right project, right price, right quality.

asr-002459
03:02:31.880 --> 03:02:36.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa right project po, ang kriteriya namin dyan, tao, lupa, tubig.

asr-002460
03:02:36.660 --> 03:02:37.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May request ba ang mga tao?

asr-002461
03:02:38.240 --> 03:02:40.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil baka lagyan mo ng patubig, wala naman magsasaka.

asr-002462
03:02:40.720 --> 03:02:44.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At ang NIA po kasi, very unique yung aming paggawa ng pundo, project.

asr-002463
03:02:45.400 --> 03:02:51.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil after po ng project, kailangan namin i-turn over sa ating mga farmers yung nagawang proyekto

asr-002464
03:02:51.300 --> 03:02:53.380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: para naman sa operation and maintenance.

asr-002465
03:02:53.680 --> 03:02:54.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ganon po yung sa NIA.

asr-002466
03:02:54.600 --> 03:02:55.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan.

asr-002467
03:02:55.460 --> 03:02:58.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan may tao, tubig. Meron bang source ng tubig?

asr-002468
03:02:58.660 --> 03:03:04.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At of course, pangatlo, yung lupa nga.

asr-002469
03:03:04.960 --> 03:03:06.460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ilang hectares ba ito?

asr-002470
03:03:07.900 --> 03:03:10.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Feasible ba ito na gawin doon sa gagastusin?

asr-002471
03:03:11.620 --> 03:03:18.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, again, Mr. Chair, madali po natin sabihin na tapos na sana po ito.

asr-002472
03:03:18.340 --> 03:03:20.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero we should put our money where our mouth is.

asr-002473
03:03:21.280 --> 03:03:23.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair, doon sa sinabi ni Administrator.

asr-002474
03:03:23.880 --> 03:03:25.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi babanggitin na naman.

asr-002475
03:03:25.460 --> 03:03:26.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair, doon sa sinabi ni Administrator.

asr-002476
03:03:26.500 --> 03:03:26.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair, doon sa sinabi ni Administrator.

asr-002477
03:03:26.540 --> 03:03:26.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair, doon sa sinabi ni Administrator.

asr-002478
03:03:26.640 --> 03:03:28.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, umihingi po kayo ng 46 billion.

asr-002479
03:03:29.560 --> 03:03:33.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam niyo po, yung People's Budget Coalition, flinag kayo, NIA.

asr-002480
03:03:34.400 --> 03:03:39.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kayo ay merong recurring pattern of anomalous infrastructure insertions

asr-002481
03:03:39.860 --> 03:03:46.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: in the same category as DPWH flood control corruption controversy.

asr-002482
03:03:47.020 --> 03:03:53.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi wala namang mga public project level document trail sa mga NIA project.

asr-002483
03:03:53.540 --> 03:03:55.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Paano niyo po i-explain ito?

asr-002484
03:03:55.460 --> 03:04:00.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung tagging, yung transparency sa mga NIA projects, Mr. Chair?

asr-002485
03:04:01.420 --> 03:04:02.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Admin, please answer.

asr-002486
03:04:04.140 --> 03:04:10.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang project po natin ay nag-undergo po ito ng mga technical validation,

asr-002487
03:04:11.020 --> 03:04:15.620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: prioritization, costing, and assessment of implementation readiness na po.

asr-002488
03:04:16.300 --> 03:04:20.100
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang project po, lahat po ng project na NIA,

asr-002489
03:04:20.100 --> 03:04:24.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ay subject to DBM evaluation and budget rules,

asr-002490
03:04:24.080 --> 03:04:26.400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung governing procurement laws,

asr-002491
03:04:26.680 --> 03:04:28.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: COA auditing requirements,

asr-002492
03:04:28.680 --> 03:04:31.100
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung approved engineering plans and technical specification,

asr-002493
03:04:32.060 --> 03:04:34.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: environmental and other regulatory requirements,

asr-002494
03:04:35.160 --> 03:04:37.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: monitoring and reporting to Congress.

asr-002495
03:04:37.380 --> 03:04:38.660
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nagre-report din po kami sa Congress.

asr-002496
03:04:39.460 --> 03:04:40.620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And of course, yung aming,

asr-002497
03:04:41.100 --> 03:04:46.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: strict po kami doon sa tinatawag naming right project, right price, right quality.

asr-002498
03:04:46.860 --> 03:04:50.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya po, unfair, yung NIA po, kung titignan niyo,

asr-002499
03:04:50.760 --> 03:04:53.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: wala naman po kami na i-report na cost projects.

asr-002500
03:04:54.080 --> 03:04:57.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Wala naman pong substandard projects na i-report, ano po.

asr-002501
03:04:58.280 --> 03:05:04.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: In fact, noong nakaraan po, ay ininbita namin ang Senado,

asr-002502
03:05:05.320 --> 03:05:09.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang pamunuan ng Senado, para po personal napuntahan at inspeksyonin

asr-002503
03:05:09.580 --> 03:05:15.000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang construction methodology, ang implementation ng project ng NIA,

asr-002504
03:05:15.000 --> 03:05:21.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: at kausapin mismo yung ating mga magsasaka kung meron silang reklamo sa NIA.

asr-002505
03:05:22.200 --> 03:05:24.000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: E ito ang tuwa naman po ang pamunuan.

asr-002506
03:05:24.080 --> 03:05:28.220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, I would like to extend the same invitation to the House.

asr-002507
03:05:28.720 --> 03:05:31.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Puntahan po natin, pasyalan natin ang mga proyekto ng NIA.

asr-002508
03:05:32.800 --> 03:05:35.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At para po, alam niyo po kasi ito, Mr. Chair,

asr-002509
03:05:36.100 --> 03:05:41.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: importante po kasi ito na hindi po ito kasi para sa ahensya namin,

asr-002510
03:05:41.380 --> 03:05:42.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang hinihingi namin tulong.

asr-002511
03:05:43.520 --> 03:05:47.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nakita naman po natin ang limited budget po ng NIA.

asr-002512
03:05:47.520 --> 03:05:50.700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Uulitin ko po, nagpapasalamat kami sa Congreso,

asr-002513
03:05:50.700 --> 03:05:53.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: dahil for the past three years, tinadagdagan niyo ang budget namin.

asr-002514
03:05:54.080 --> 03:05:58.140
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero ang appeal namin kasi dito, it's not for our agency,

asr-002515
03:05:58.520 --> 03:06:00.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pero para po ito sa ating mga magsasaka.

asr-002516
03:06:00.760 --> 03:06:03.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Tama po lahat ang concern ng ating mga congressman.

asr-002517
03:06:04.120 --> 03:06:08.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan po natin lahat ang irigasyon, pero kailangan po natin magtulungan dito.

asr-002518
03:06:09.040 --> 03:06:14.380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi mo ako pwedeng paghanapan po ng isang napakalaking accomplishment,

asr-002519
03:06:14.860 --> 03:06:17.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pero napakaliit naman yung aming allocation.

asr-002520
03:06:17.460 --> 03:06:18.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002521
03:06:18.240 --> 03:06:21.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Administrator, huwag niyo naman ibatod dito sa Congreso.

asr-002522
03:06:24.080 --> 03:06:25.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pabalik mo dito at admin eh.

asr-002523
03:06:26.280 --> 03:06:27.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa Congress yung problema eh.

asr-002524
03:06:28.400 --> 03:06:31.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sinasabi nyo, pinagmamalaki nyo, lakay yung substandard, lakay yung mga ghost project.

asr-002525
03:06:32.180 --> 03:06:34.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: E iba naman ang sinasabi ng mga magsasaka on the ground eh.

asr-002526
03:06:36.280 --> 03:06:37.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: E sasabi mo, hindi totoo, Administrator.

asr-002527
03:06:38.700 --> 03:06:43.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero may disconnect sa kung anong nire-report ninyo sa nangyayari sa mga magsasaka on the ground.

asr-002528
03:06:44.220 --> 03:06:46.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya huwag niyo sisihin pabalik dito sa Congreso.

asr-002529
03:06:46.000 --> 03:06:51.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya nga tayo nagkakaroon ng hearing para mabusisi natin yung budget ninyo, yung inihingi ninyo.

asr-002530
03:06:51.620 --> 03:06:53.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sinasabi nyo, limited fiscal space.

asr-002531
03:06:54.080 --> 03:06:56.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tignan natin nasaan yung implementation gaps.

asr-002532
03:06:56.440 --> 03:06:57.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama ba yun, Administrator?

asr-002533
03:06:58.220 --> 03:07:01.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O kaya huwag niyo pong masamain, Administrator, kasi parang may namasama nyo eh.

asr-002534
03:07:02.280 --> 03:07:03.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002535
03:07:05.260 --> 03:07:07.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually, gusto ko lang liwanagin.

asr-002536
03:07:07.620 --> 03:07:11.100
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi ko po ipinapasa sa Congreso ang problema ng...

asr-002537
03:07:11.100 --> 03:07:15.820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Huwag ko, nagpapasalamat po ako sa inyong mga tulong po sa amin for the past three years.

asr-002538
03:07:15.820 --> 03:07:21.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil makikita po for the record, dinadagdagan po talaga ng Congreso yung aming budget.

asr-002539
03:07:21.620 --> 03:07:23.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: You have the power of the purse.

asr-002540
03:07:24.080 --> 03:07:24.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair.

asr-002541
03:07:25.520 --> 03:07:29.220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At doon po, nag-a-appeal ang NIA ng tulong.

asr-002542
03:07:29.600 --> 03:07:33.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi po namin binabato po ang sisi po sa Congreso.

asr-002543
03:07:34.060 --> 03:07:36.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Bagkos, humihingo po kami ng tulong, Mr. Chair.

asr-002544
03:07:37.020 --> 03:07:44.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, makikihingi na lang po ako ng NIA Irrigation Projects under Agrarian Reform Fund listahan po.

asr-002545
03:07:44.700 --> 03:07:49.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At yung guidelines dito sa ARF, Mr. Chair.

asr-002546
03:07:49.540 --> 03:07:52.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sana po maibigay agad ng NIA to Mr. Chair.

asr-002547
03:07:52.760 --> 03:07:54.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Will the NIA commit to...

asr-002548
03:07:54.080 --> 03:07:54.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Will that, Mr. Chair?

asr-002549
03:07:56.200 --> 03:07:59.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair. We will submit it as of po. Thank you.

asr-002550
03:07:59.580 --> 03:08:04.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po. Mr. Chair, baubos na oras ko. Pero may ilang katanungan lang po ako sa DA ulit.

asr-002551
03:08:05.860 --> 03:08:09.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Partikular naman po ito sa Coco Levy Fund, Sekretary.

asr-002552
03:08:09.600 --> 03:08:11.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong nag-run po, nagkaroon ng committee hearing dito.

asr-002553
03:08:13.220 --> 03:08:14.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Inaamendahan po yung batas.

asr-002554
03:08:15.060 --> 03:08:23.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Doon po sa batas, ang gusto po ng mga magnunyog, Section 10 particularly, maisama sila sa Trust Fund Management Committee.

asr-002555
03:08:24.080 --> 03:08:25.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Doon po ang sabi ng Department of Finance.

asr-002556
03:08:26.480 --> 03:08:28.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya nagagalit po ako dyan sa Department of Finance.

asr-002557
03:08:28.620 --> 03:08:33.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi, eh hindi naman daw dapat kailangan yung mga magnunyog kasama sa Trust Fund Management Committee.

asr-002558
03:08:35.300 --> 03:08:37.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Eh laking kalukuhan nun, Sekretary.

asr-002559
03:08:38.160 --> 03:08:42.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Papaanong hindi isasama yung mga magnunyog doon sa Trust Fund Management Committee

asr-002560
03:08:42.120 --> 03:08:48.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung yung Coco Levy Fund, pera ng mga magnunyog, ipinagkatiwala lang sa gobyerno.

asr-002561
03:08:49.100 --> 03:08:54.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Gusto ko pong malaman muli, makuha, ano po ang posisyon ng Department of Agriculture.

asr-002562
03:08:54.080 --> 03:08:59.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng PCA po, doon sa pag-amyenda particularly on Section 10

asr-002563
03:08:59.260 --> 03:09:05.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na dapat isama yung farmers representatives, yung mga magnunyog sa Trust Fund Management Committee.

asr-002564
03:09:05.860 --> 03:09:07.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, please answer.

asr-002565
03:09:07.480 --> 03:09:10.300
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, as far as the DA is concerned,

asr-002566
03:09:10.680 --> 03:09:18.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: palagi namin kasama ang aming stakeholders, lalo na ang aming mga farmers sa lahat ng aming plano.

asr-002567
03:09:18.920 --> 03:09:22.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, definitely the DA's position is...

asr-002568
03:09:24.080 --> 03:09:27.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Isa lang kami ng mga magsasaka.

asr-002569
03:09:27.540 --> 03:09:28.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, mas magandang kasama sila.

asr-002570
03:09:28.900 --> 03:09:31.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair, doon po sa assurance.

asr-002571
03:09:31.540 --> 03:09:33.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Buti pa ang Department of Agriculture.

asr-002572
03:09:34.660 --> 03:09:36.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: May categorical position.

asr-002573
03:09:37.020 --> 03:09:40.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung Department of Finance, mga luko-loko yung mga nandun eh.

asr-002574
03:09:40.720 --> 03:09:43.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pasensya, Mr. Chair, but I have to say this.

asr-002575
03:09:44.080 --> 03:09:47.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero yung pera nila, ayaw isama yung mga magnunyog sa Trust Fund Management Committee.

asr-002576
03:09:47.520 --> 03:09:50.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And I am very happy to hear that from our Secretary sa DA.

asr-002577
03:09:51.560 --> 03:09:53.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nakasangga ang DA ng mga magnunyog natin.

asr-002578
03:09:53.540 --> 03:09:56.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: With that, Mr. Chair, second round po ako mamaya. Palista na lang po ako.

asr-002579
03:09:57.000 --> 03:09:57.860
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay, thank you.

asr-002580
03:09:59.720 --> 03:10:07.900
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The Chair recognizes Rep. Marlo Bancoro from the majority.

asr-002581
03:10:08.600 --> 03:10:10.000
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002582
03:10:10.760 --> 03:10:13.420
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Good afternoon, Secretary Laurel. Good afternoon, everyone.

asr-002583
03:10:14.580 --> 03:10:19.540
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Unang-una, Secretary Laurel, thank you very much doon sa commitment natin sa FISPORT.

asr-002584
03:10:19.540 --> 03:10:20.180
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: FISPORT.

asr-002585
03:10:20.940 --> 03:10:22.540
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Nabigyan po tayo na ng three-year...

asr-002586
03:10:23.540 --> 03:10:26.420
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ...implementation in the amount of 150 million.

asr-002587
03:10:26.920 --> 03:10:32.860
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: I just want to make it clear na sana po hindi talaga maputol kasi three-year do eh.

asr-002588
03:10:33.360 --> 03:10:38.560
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So for the next year, may 60 million and that's succeeding year 2028-67.

asr-002589
03:10:39.060 --> 03:10:42.180
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi sayang rin yun yung plano natin na expansion kung hindi maputol.

asr-002590
03:10:42.180 --> 03:10:45.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair. Nasa plano na ho yan, Mr. Chair.

asr-002591
03:10:45.180 --> 03:10:46.640
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you very much, Secretary.

asr-002592
03:10:46.860 --> 03:10:50.880
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Second is salamat rin sa yung Hatchery, Mega Hatchery.

asr-002593
03:10:51.580 --> 03:10:53.180
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: And I am looking forward to...

asr-002594
03:10:53.540 --> 03:11:06.960
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ...see you some of these days para makita mo, ano, one of these days, I mean, para makita mo talaga yung lugar kung saan itatayo natin yung Mega Hatchery.

asr-002595
03:11:10.530 --> 03:11:17.850
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ang pangatlo ko, Secretary Laurel, na problema natin, yung FMR.

asr-002596
03:11:19.050 --> 03:11:23.950
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Last year, sa NEP, nabigyan po tayo ng apat kasi yung lugar namin, agricultural...

asr-002597
03:11:25.530 --> 03:11:32.850
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ...province kami. So, in fact, yung na-validate natin is more than 200 farm-to-market roads.

asr-002598
03:11:33.370 --> 03:11:40.090
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Apat lang yung naibigay sa atin. Unfortunately, nung lumabas ang GAA, dalawa ang nawala.

asr-002599
03:11:40.530 --> 03:11:45.590
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, if you recall, I went to your office. Sabi mo, hanapan mo ng paraan.

asr-002600
03:11:47.110 --> 03:11:53.010
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ang problema, nung tinignan ko ang NEP ngayon, dalawa lang ang nailagay sa akin.

asr-002601
03:11:53.530 --> 03:11:55.410
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yung commitment natin na nawala ang dalawa.

asr-002602
03:11:55.530 --> 03:11:56.890
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Hindi naibalik.

asr-002603
03:11:57.730 --> 03:12:08.450
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: At what is worse there, Mr. Chairman, Secretary, yung dalawang naibigay nyo sa akin, 2026 budget,

asr-002604
03:12:11.130 --> 03:12:18.770
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: hindi pa na-implement ngayon dahil yung isa, o yung dalawa, in fact, may nagka-problema sa funding.

asr-002605
03:12:18.770 --> 03:12:26.770
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi, nung in-apply ng DPWH yung standard program works nila, nagkukulang.

asr-002606
03:12:27.350 --> 03:12:29.210
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi, yung lugar is swampy.

asr-002607
03:12:29.730 --> 03:12:32.790
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, that's why we agreed na ibalik ko na lang sa inyo, kayo na pang bahala.

asr-002608
03:12:33.670 --> 03:12:39.170
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yun na nga, nung gumawa ng program of works yung office nyo, lagpas.

asr-002609
03:12:39.370 --> 03:12:41.090
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kulang yung 15 million in one kilometer.

asr-002610
03:12:42.270 --> 03:12:47.070
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, sabi mo sa akin, kayo na bahala, dagdagan ninyo para matapos ang one kilometer.

asr-002611
03:12:47.210 --> 03:12:49.230
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi, people are expecting that project.

asr-002612
03:12:49.790 --> 03:12:54.930
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Unfortunately, tinignan ko rin sa NEP ngayon, kulang ng 18 million para matapos.

asr-002613
03:12:54.930 --> 03:12:56.930
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Hindi ko makita sa NEP kung...

asr-002614
03:12:57.890 --> 03:13:00.430
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Saan kayo kukuha ng source para matapos yun?

asr-002615
03:13:04.250 --> 03:13:10.270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, yung una nga, apat yung ating naka-plano dyan.

asr-002616
03:13:10.450 --> 03:13:14.330
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, of course, we were assuming the fiscal space na meron kami.

asr-002617
03:13:14.590 --> 03:13:20.790
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Like, akala namin yung budget for 2027 is same as 2026 na 33.

asr-002618
03:13:20.970 --> 03:13:24.050
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, unfortunately, kalahati rin yung nakuha namin.

asr-002619
03:13:25.130 --> 03:13:28.970
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But then, ngayon, sa ngayon,

asr-002620
03:13:29.910 --> 03:13:38.570
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: nabanggit ko rin nga talaga sa inyo na susubukan natin punuin yung natitirang kulang doon sa kilometro.

asr-002621
03:13:39.310 --> 03:13:46.170
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At ang nakikita namin paraan is meron kaming nakikita na unimplementables sa FMR ng 2026.

asr-002622
03:13:46.890 --> 03:13:52.330
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Doon namin planong kunin doon sa mga projects na hindi ma-implement.

asr-002623
03:13:52.330 --> 03:13:59.790
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dahil nga, let's say, dating pwedeng implement, tapos nabaha na ngayon at na-wash out.

asr-002624
03:13:59.910 --> 03:14:02.130
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At hindi na pwedeng gawan ng kalye.

asr-002625
03:14:03.290 --> 03:14:05.490
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yun yung mga ganong klase yung nakikita namin.

asr-002626
03:14:05.690 --> 03:14:11.470
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I will take note, Mr. Chair, and coordinate closely with Kong Bancoro on this matter.

asr-002627
03:14:11.510 --> 03:14:12.230
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002628
03:14:12.350 --> 03:14:18.850
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, assured na tayo na matapos talaga yun kasi mahihiyan naman tayo sa mga tao na kulang, hindi tapos.

asr-002629
03:14:19.430 --> 03:14:22.310
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yung dalawang nawala ko, Mr. Chair, anong commitment natin doon?

asr-002630
03:14:24.130 --> 03:14:26.230
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yung dalawang FMR natin na nawala?

asr-002631
03:14:26.230 --> 03:14:26.290
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Anong commitment natin na nawala?

asr-002632
03:14:26.290 --> 03:14:37.830
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung dalawang nawala, sa ngayon, kung hindi madadagdagan ng FMR budget, Mr. Chair, ng DA for 2027,

asr-002633
03:14:38.730 --> 03:14:48.030
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yun ang aming, kung pwedeng pagtulong-tulungan natin na madagdagan yung FMR budget sa final gaah, I think, yun ang isang paraan, Mr. Chair.

asr-002634
03:14:48.870 --> 03:14:51.650
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sige po, aasahan ko po yun, Mr. Chair.

asr-002635
03:14:52.130 --> 03:14:54.910
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Tsaka susulat rin ako dyan for that purpose para on record siya.

asr-002636
03:14:55.170 --> 03:14:56.270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002637
03:14:56.290 --> 03:14:59.930
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Okay, dito muna na ako sa administrator ng NEA.

asr-002638
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:01.700
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Balikan lang kita mamaya,

asr-002639
03:15:01.940 --> 03:15:02.700
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sekretary Laurel.

asr-002640
03:15:03.180 --> 03:15:04.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sir, Admin.

asr-002641
03:15:04.840 --> 03:15:05.780
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ang problema ko kasi,

asr-002642
03:15:06.140 --> 03:15:07.040
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sir Admin,

asr-002643
03:15:07.380 --> 03:15:08.100
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ito ang problema.

asr-002644
03:15:08.280 --> 03:15:09.400
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Pakipakita, Sekretary.

asr-002645
03:15:10.700 --> 03:15:12.140
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Last year, if you recall,

asr-002646
03:15:13.140 --> 03:15:14.620
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ang manifestation ko is,

asr-002647
03:15:15.800 --> 03:15:19.040
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: huwag mo na akong lagyan ng solar irrigation

asr-002648
03:15:19.040 --> 03:15:21.540
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: kasi mayroon pa akong dam

asr-002649
03:15:21.540 --> 03:15:23.080
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: na hindi pa talaga tapos.

asr-002650
03:15:23.760 --> 03:15:24.620
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, ang dam kasi,

asr-002651
03:15:24.900 --> 03:15:26.200
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: importante yan dahil

asr-002652
03:15:26.200 --> 03:15:27.740
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: sigurado tayong may tubig.

asr-002653
03:15:27.740 --> 03:15:30.100
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Iyong solar kasi,

asr-002654
03:15:30.200 --> 03:15:31.760
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: hindi natin alam yung

asr-002655
03:15:31.760 --> 03:15:34.760
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: water table niyan,

asr-002656
03:15:34.840 --> 03:15:36.000
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: maobos 2 to 3 years.

asr-002657
03:15:36.420 --> 03:15:37.300
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, yun ang ano ko.

asr-002658
03:15:38.020 --> 03:15:38.500
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Unfortunately,

asr-002659
03:15:39.220 --> 03:15:40.020
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: sinabi mo sa akin,

asr-002660
03:15:40.160 --> 03:15:41.300
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: okay, pagbigyan ako.

asr-002661
03:15:41.800 --> 03:15:42.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Pero wala.

asr-002662
03:15:42.860 --> 03:15:43.620
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Walang nangyari.

asr-002663
03:15:44.940 --> 03:15:45.140
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So,

asr-002664
03:15:46.440 --> 03:15:47.100
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ang ginawa mo,

asr-002665
03:15:47.740 --> 03:15:49.320
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: naglagay ka pa rin ng solar irrigation,

asr-002666
03:15:49.960 --> 03:15:51.040
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ito, isang sample oh.

asr-002667
03:15:51.980 --> 03:15:52.860
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Wala, hanggang ngayon.

asr-002668
03:15:53.660 --> 03:15:54.380
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Palpak pa rin.

asr-002669
03:15:54.820 --> 03:15:55.940
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, ito ang point ko,

asr-002670
03:15:55.940 --> 03:15:57.640
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Mr. Administrator.

asr-002671
03:15:57.740 --> 03:15:58.000
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sir,

asr-002672
03:15:58.960 --> 03:16:00.460
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: tapusin natin itong dam, sir.

asr-002673
03:16:01.320 --> 03:16:02.120
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi yung dam,

asr-002674
03:16:03.600 --> 03:16:05.020
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: siguro, mamamatay na lang tayo.

asr-002675
03:16:05.340 --> 03:16:05.720
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ano pa yan?

asr-002676
03:16:05.800 --> 03:16:06.700
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi malaki yung river.

asr-002677
03:16:06.760 --> 03:16:08.140
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: River basin ang source eh.

asr-002678
03:16:08.800 --> 03:16:10.300
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, malaking tulong.

asr-002679
03:16:10.400 --> 03:16:11.320
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Saka, sayang, sir.

asr-002680
03:16:11.880 --> 03:16:14.040
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sayang yung pundo ng gobyerno

asr-002681
03:16:14.040 --> 03:16:15.480
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: na nilagay dyan,

asr-002682
03:16:15.580 --> 03:16:16.720
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: hundred of millions,

asr-002683
03:16:17.300 --> 03:16:19.280
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ngayon, hindi matapos-tapos.

asr-002684
03:16:20.000 --> 03:16:21.200
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, that's it.

asr-002685
03:16:23.900 --> 03:16:24.120
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Yes.

asr-002686
03:16:24.900 --> 03:16:25.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Apo, admin?

asr-002687
03:16:26.360 --> 03:16:27.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002688
03:16:28.780 --> 03:16:29.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nandun ako.

asr-002689
03:16:29.600 --> 03:16:31.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair, I agree with the good congressman.

asr-002690
03:16:31.640 --> 03:16:34.220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya nga po, for 2027,

asr-002691
03:16:34.640 --> 03:16:36.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang proposal namin sa kanyang distrito,

asr-002692
03:16:36.840 --> 03:16:38.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: at alam nito ng ating mahal na congressman,

asr-002693
03:16:38.760 --> 03:16:41.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: is 1.12 billion, Mr. Chair.

asr-002694
03:16:42.400 --> 03:16:44.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang lumabas sa NEP is only 29 million.

asr-002695
03:16:45.480 --> 03:16:46.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya,

asr-002696
03:16:46.840 --> 03:16:48.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ako man, Mr. Chair, ano,

asr-002697
03:16:48.720 --> 03:16:50.140
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ay nalulungkot din.

asr-002698
03:16:50.140 --> 03:16:52.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero, dahil nga, uulitin ko.

asr-002699
03:16:53.180 --> 03:16:54.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung fiscal limitation eh,

asr-002700
03:16:54.640 --> 03:16:55.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: doon ho tayo limited.

asr-002701
03:16:55.760 --> 03:16:58.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kahit na magtatumbling ko po ako rito ngayon,

asr-002702
03:16:58.560 --> 03:16:59.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: gusto kong gawin lahat,

asr-002703
03:16:59.480 --> 03:17:01.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung request nyo sa akin,

asr-002704
03:17:01.480 --> 03:17:03.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: kung kulang naman po ang pundo namin,

asr-002705
03:17:03.480 --> 03:17:05.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: wala rin po tayong magagawa.

asr-002706
03:17:05.480 --> 03:17:08.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya po, pinapriorite namin, Mr. Chair,

asr-002707
03:17:08.480 --> 03:17:10.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung mga pwede na po natin gawin.

asr-002708
03:17:10.480 --> 03:17:15.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At, well, you know,

asr-002709
03:17:15.480 --> 03:17:17.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: hindi pa naman, meron pa naman ano eh.

asr-002710
03:17:17.980 --> 03:17:19.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Again, ito naman ay,

asr-002711
03:17:19.980 --> 03:17:21.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NEP pa lang naman po ito, Mr. Chair.

asr-002712
03:17:21.980 --> 03:17:22.980
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Excuse me, with all your respect.

asr-002713
03:17:22.980 --> 03:17:24.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Actually, yung sagot mo, sir,

asr-002714
03:17:24.240 --> 03:17:26.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: same sa sagot mo sa akin last year.

asr-002715
03:17:26.240 --> 03:17:28.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Wala na, fiscal space, ganun-ganun-ganun.

asr-002716
03:17:28.240 --> 03:17:30.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Pero, ang problema,

asr-002717
03:17:30.240 --> 03:17:33.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: yun na nga, maliit lang budget binigay mo.

asr-002718
03:17:33.240 --> 03:17:38.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: And, nalaman ko na lang, may binaba kayo solar irrigation na wala,

asr-002719
03:17:38.240 --> 03:17:40.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: wala, hindi priority namin.

asr-002720
03:17:40.240 --> 03:17:42.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Binaba doon sa lugar ko.

asr-002721
03:17:42.240 --> 03:17:44.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sabi ko, instead na,

asr-002722
03:17:44.240 --> 03:17:46.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: bakit ako binigyan ng solar irrigation,

asr-002723
03:17:46.240 --> 03:17:48.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: na ito ang priority namin.

asr-002724
03:17:48.240 --> 03:17:49.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, yun ang point ko.

asr-002725
03:17:49.240 --> 03:17:51.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ngayon, kunwari, binigyan mo ako,

asr-002726
03:17:51.240 --> 03:17:53.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: matanggap natin yan na ganito yung amount.

asr-002727
03:17:53.240 --> 03:17:55.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Pero, baka naman, later on,

asr-002728
03:17:55.240 --> 03:17:57.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: bigyan naman naman ako na solar irrigation.

asr-002729
03:17:57.240 --> 03:17:59.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, unahin muna natin ito.

asr-002730
03:17:59.240 --> 03:18:02.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ito talaga ang priority namin, sir.

asr-002731
03:18:02.240 --> 03:18:08.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Lahat po ng priority ng ating mga mabuti ng Congress Bank,

asr-002732
03:18:08.240 --> 03:18:09.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: nasa amin naman,

asr-002733
03:18:09.240 --> 03:18:11.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yun ang ipapriority natin ako, Congress Bank.

asr-002734
03:18:11.240 --> 03:18:13.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Salamat, sir.

asr-002735
03:18:13.240 --> 03:18:16.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Last na lang, kay Sekretary Laurel.

asr-002736
03:18:16.240 --> 03:18:17.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Sir, one.

asr-002737
03:18:17.240 --> 03:18:18.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: National concern, sir,

asr-002738
03:18:18.240 --> 03:18:20.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: on agriculture,

asr-002739
03:18:20.240 --> 03:18:22.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: organic agriculture.

asr-002740
03:18:22.240 --> 03:18:25.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ano yung direction natin dyan, sir?

asr-002741
03:18:25.240 --> 03:18:26.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi,

asr-002742
03:18:26.240 --> 03:18:27.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: napansin namin,

asr-002743
03:18:27.240 --> 03:18:30.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: ang budget ng organic agriculture,

asr-002744
03:18:30.240 --> 03:18:32.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: based, of course, ng NUAB, no?

asr-002745
03:18:32.240 --> 03:18:34.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yung presentation ng NUAB sa budget niya.

asr-002746
03:18:34.240 --> 03:18:35.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Ang problema lang,

asr-002747
03:18:35.240 --> 03:18:38.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: pagbaba doon sa every region,

asr-002748
03:18:38.240 --> 03:18:40.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: mag-iiba ang direction.

asr-002749
03:18:40.240 --> 03:18:43.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: So, sana, we can,

asr-002750
03:18:43.240 --> 03:18:46.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: I know we have limited time here.

asr-002751
03:18:46.240 --> 03:18:48.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: If you give me some time,

asr-002752
03:18:48.240 --> 03:18:49.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: one of these days,

asr-002753
03:18:49.240 --> 03:18:50.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: pupunta ko sa office nyo,

asr-002754
03:18:50.240 --> 03:18:52.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: pwedeng upuan natin ito, sir?

asr-002755
03:18:52.240 --> 03:18:55.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Kasi, advocate po ako ng organic agriculture.

asr-002756
03:18:55.240 --> 03:18:57.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you, sir.

asr-002757
03:18:57.240 --> 03:18:59.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: I will officially write you on that.

asr-002758
03:18:59.240 --> 03:19:00.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002759
03:19:00.240 --> 03:19:04.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And we will meet with Kong Bancoro

asr-002760
03:19:04.240 --> 03:19:07.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: at the appropriate time sa schedule nyo.

asr-002761
03:19:07.240 --> 03:19:09.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At papatawag natin ang head ng NUAB

asr-002762
03:19:09.240 --> 03:19:14.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: na iharap sa inyo para mapag-usapan

asr-002763
03:19:14.240 --> 03:19:16.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: at madesisyonan kung ano makakailangan.

asr-002764
03:19:16.240 --> 03:19:17.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002765
03:19:17.240 --> 03:19:18.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you, sir.

asr-002766
03:19:18.240 --> 03:19:23.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: That's all, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002767
03:19:23.240 --> 03:19:24.240
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Thank you.

asr-002768
03:19:24.240 --> 03:19:26.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you. Medyo hina-high blood

asr-002769
03:19:26.240 --> 03:19:27.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: si Apo.

asr-002770
03:19:27.240 --> 03:19:31.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Next.

asr-002771
03:19:31.240 --> 03:19:33.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The chair recognizes

asr-002772
03:19:33.240 --> 03:19:35.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Honorable Presley De Jesus

asr-002773
03:19:35.240 --> 03:19:38.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: from minority.

asr-002774
03:19:38.240 --> 03:19:40.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ah, wala na siya.

asr-002775
03:19:40.240 --> 03:19:42.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay.

asr-002776
03:19:42.240 --> 03:19:45.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Next, the chair recognizes

asr-002777
03:19:45.240 --> 03:19:49.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Honorable Raymond Mendoza.

asr-002778
03:19:49.240 --> 03:19:52.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Chair, you have five minutes.

asr-002779
03:19:52.240 --> 03:19:54.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Daghang salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-002780
03:19:54.240 --> 03:19:55.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Daghang salamat.

asr-002781
03:19:55.240 --> 03:19:56.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mayong...

asr-002782
03:19:57.240 --> 03:19:58.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Apo na di eh.

asr-002783
03:19:58.240 --> 03:19:59.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ganyan na po kumuntang.

asr-002784
03:19:59.240 --> 03:20:01.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Secretary,

asr-002785
03:20:01.240 --> 03:20:04.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: from TUCP in the province of Cotabato, of course,

asr-002786
03:20:04.240 --> 03:20:05.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and the workers,

asr-002787
03:20:05.240 --> 03:20:06.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: tatlong industriya lang

asr-002788
03:20:06.240 --> 03:20:07.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I'd like to ask from you.

asr-002789
03:20:07.240 --> 03:20:09.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yung palm oil, banana,

asr-002790
03:20:09.240 --> 03:20:11.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and of course, the sugar industry.

asr-002791
03:20:11.240 --> 03:20:14.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Now, both of which, yung palm oil tsaka banana,

asr-002792
03:20:14.240 --> 03:20:17.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: grew with minimal government intervention.

asr-002793
03:20:17.240 --> 03:20:20.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And it has been sustained.

asr-002794
03:20:20.240 --> 03:20:22.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Combined millions of workers

asr-002795
03:20:22.240 --> 03:20:25.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: are actually affiliated with TUCP,

asr-002796
03:20:25.240 --> 03:20:26.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: especially in Mindanao.

asr-002797
03:20:26.240 --> 03:20:29.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And some parts of Negros.

asr-002798
03:20:29.240 --> 03:20:33.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ganito na lang, Mr. Secretary.

asr-002799
03:20:33.240 --> 03:20:35.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: About five days ago,

asr-002800
03:20:35.240 --> 03:20:38.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I was in the 40th Congress of the Palm Oil.

asr-002801
03:20:38.240 --> 03:20:40.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I actually was a speaker.

asr-002802
03:20:40.240 --> 03:20:43.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And I have a House Bill 7462.

asr-002803
03:20:43.240 --> 03:20:47.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The creation of Palm Oil Development Act.

asr-002804
03:20:47.240 --> 03:20:49.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Creation of an authority.

asr-002805
03:20:49.240 --> 03:20:51.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Palm Oil Development Authority.

asr-002806
03:20:51.240 --> 03:20:54.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And there were promises given by the DA,

asr-002807
03:20:54.240 --> 03:20:55.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and I would just like to validate it.

asr-002808
03:20:55.240 --> 03:20:57.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: By the way, dagang salamat.

asr-002809
03:20:57.240 --> 03:21:01.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you for Administrator or Director Buted.

asr-002810
03:21:01.240 --> 03:21:04.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And of course, kay Rosales.

asr-002811
03:21:04.240 --> 03:21:05.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Much appreciated.

asr-002812
03:21:05.240 --> 03:21:06.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Full support.

asr-002813
03:21:06.240 --> 03:21:07.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I know PCA.

asr-002814
03:21:07.240 --> 03:21:10.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Palm Oil, right now, is PCA.

asr-002815
03:21:10.240 --> 03:21:13.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And then, is a subgroup lang ang palm oil.

asr-002816
03:21:13.240 --> 03:21:16.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: But with this, it has to become an authority.

asr-002817
03:21:16.240 --> 03:21:20.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: With, what, 15,000 pesos per hectare,

asr-002818
03:21:20.240 --> 03:21:24.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: the income, you can do no wrong, Mr. Secretary.

asr-002819
03:21:25.240 --> 03:21:28.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Will you support the passage of this authority?

asr-002820
03:21:28.240 --> 03:21:35.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And of course, mas maganda kasi dalawang kongreses.

asr-002821
03:21:35.240 --> 03:21:40.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And certify as urgent for the palm oil industry,

asr-002822
03:21:40.240 --> 03:21:43.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Secretary, please.

asr-002823
03:21:43.240 --> 03:21:48.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, definitely, palm oil is an industry na

asr-002824
03:21:48.240 --> 03:21:52.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kailangan suportahan ng ating national government, no?

asr-002825
03:21:52.240 --> 03:21:53.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: As well as you, my LGUs that are,

asr-002826
03:21:53.240 --> 03:21:57.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: palm oil industries or stakeholders in their area.

asr-002827
03:21:57.240 --> 03:22:01.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dahil kumikita ho ang mga palm oil producers natin,

asr-002828
03:22:01.240 --> 03:22:06.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: farmers, at ang market is nandyan.

asr-002829
03:22:06.240 --> 03:22:10.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We are importing almost 90% of our palm oil requirements.

asr-002830
03:22:10.240 --> 03:22:12.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, import substitution yan.

asr-002831
03:22:12.240 --> 03:22:17.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At definitely, kailangan ho natin lagyan ng pondo yan.

asr-002832
03:22:17.240 --> 03:22:20.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Nakausap po si Sen. Kiko Pangilinan.

asr-002833
03:22:20.240 --> 03:22:22.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At kanina rin, kausap-ausap kahapon.

asr-002834
03:22:23.240 --> 03:22:26.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kausap ko rin si Kong Mark Inverga,

asr-002835
03:22:26.240 --> 03:22:29.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ang aming head ng Agri sa Congress,

asr-002836
03:22:29.240 --> 03:22:34.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: na humihingi ako ng additional budget para sa,

asr-002837
03:22:34.240 --> 03:22:38.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kasi hindi namin nailagay yun sa aming NEP ng malakihan

asr-002838
03:22:38.240 --> 03:22:42.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: dahil nga ngayon lang namin nakita the last two months

asr-002839
03:22:42.240 --> 03:22:47.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yung talagang real need na kailangan i-prop up yung ano.

asr-002840
03:22:47.240 --> 03:22:50.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, we will re-request you for a special provision

asr-002841
03:22:50.240 --> 03:22:53.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: on the palm oil na madagdagan ng NEP ng palm oil for,

asr-002842
03:22:53.240 --> 03:22:56.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ng 500 million for next year.

asr-002843
03:22:56.240 --> 03:22:59.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: In the following years onward, sana nga kung may batas,

asr-002844
03:22:59.240 --> 03:23:04.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: malagyan ng isang billion yan bawat taon for the next five years.

asr-002845
03:23:04.240 --> 03:23:09.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kung tungkol naman sa authority, ang importante lang ho,

asr-002846
03:23:09.240 --> 03:23:14.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: makabuo tayo ng isang ahensya man,

asr-002847
03:23:14.240 --> 03:23:21.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: o kaya i-reorganize ang PCA na hindi lang coconut authority siya,

asr-002848
03:23:21.240 --> 03:23:26.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: na pwede magkaroon ng deputy administrator specifically for palm oil

asr-002849
03:23:26.240 --> 03:23:30.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: at isang deputy administrator specifically for coconut

asr-002850
03:23:30.240 --> 03:23:32.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para at may sarili silang teams.

asr-002851
03:23:32.240 --> 03:23:37.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I think maganda yan at mas mabilis as an idea

asr-002852
03:23:37.240 --> 03:23:43.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para maging dalawang line, para maging line agencies yan, may specific functions.

asr-002853
03:23:43.240 --> 03:23:46.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Secretary, that's a very good news.

asr-002854
03:23:46.240 --> 03:23:49.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Okay lang ako even though sabi ko palm oil authority,

asr-002855
03:23:49.240 --> 03:23:53.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: but if you now split it into several products,

asr-002856
03:23:53.240 --> 03:23:58.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: well and good, the TUCP would adhere to your idea.

asr-002857
03:23:58.240 --> 03:24:02.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Pero ang importante lang, Mr. Secretary, na dapat i-certify urgent.

asr-002858
03:24:02.240 --> 03:24:07.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Can you make, please, ibulong na lang kay Pangulo,

asr-002859
03:24:07.240 --> 03:24:10.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: mahal natin Pangulo na dapat naman na, you know,

asr-002860
03:24:10.240 --> 03:24:16.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: for the workers, we are importing 100 billion yata, if I'm told,

asr-002861
03:24:16.240 --> 03:24:18.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: of palm oil each year.

asr-002862
03:24:18.240 --> 03:24:24.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So dapat naman na we will increase with only 100,000 planted of hectares.

asr-002863
03:24:24.240 --> 03:24:26.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Is that correct, Mr. Secretary?

asr-002864
03:24:26.240 --> 03:24:30.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang idea ho natin, ang nakita namin na roadmap kailangan,

asr-002865
03:24:30.240 --> 03:24:33.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: we have to plant 300,000 hectares of palm oil.

asr-002866
03:24:33.240 --> 03:24:42.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At kung maka 100,000 hectares tayo by 2028, end of 2028, magandang maganda na ho yun.

asr-002867
03:24:42.240 --> 03:24:47.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At the DA definitely supports the certification of the palm oil bill.

asr-002868
03:24:47.240 --> 03:24:53.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: As urgent, and I will make my official recommendation tomorrow to the President, Mr. Chair.

asr-002869
03:24:53.240 --> 03:24:55.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-002870
03:24:55.240 --> 03:24:58.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And then, of course, I've seen it work in Thailand.

asr-002871
03:24:58.240 --> 03:25:03.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: It's a conflict crop na talagang yung dati nakakalabaw lang.

asr-002872
03:25:03.240 --> 03:25:09.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And now, even in Cotabato, you see them driving multi-cabs and pickup trucks, then trucks.

asr-002873
03:25:09.240 --> 03:25:11.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So it works.

asr-002874
03:25:11.240 --> 03:25:15.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So I hope it's for poverty alleviation and also commitment natin sa barn.

asr-002875
03:25:15.240 --> 03:25:17.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Na dapat i-ano. Please, sir.

asr-002876
03:25:17.240 --> 03:25:24.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: May I get an assurance that you will at least talk to the President na certified urgent?

asr-002877
03:25:24.240 --> 03:25:26.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ano lang si Katsi Presidente?

asr-002878
03:25:26.240 --> 03:25:30.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair. We will make our official recommendation tomorrow, Mr. Chair.

asr-002879
03:25:30.240 --> 03:25:32.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, sir. Thank you, sir.

asr-002880
03:25:32.240 --> 03:25:34.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Next, sir, is banana.

asr-002881
03:25:34.240 --> 03:25:40.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Tomorrow, I'd like to thank you also the usual support from Yusek Yang of high value.

asr-002882
03:25:40.240 --> 03:25:43.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, sir. And I'm going to meet him in Hong Kong.

asr-002883
03:25:43.240 --> 03:25:46.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: We're going to cut the ribbon for the Banana Congress.

asr-002884
03:25:46.240 --> 03:25:48.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ito lang, diretso lang, Mr. Secretary.

asr-002885
03:25:48.240 --> 03:25:51.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: You know naman that we used to be number two.

asr-002886
03:25:51.240 --> 03:25:54.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Now, we went down to number four.

asr-002887
03:25:54.240 --> 03:25:57.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Sometimes, we go number six.

asr-002888
03:25:57.240 --> 03:26:05.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Karamihan nitong mga manggagawa sa banana industry, especially in Windanao, are actually affiliated with TUCP.

asr-002889
03:26:05.240 --> 03:26:08.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Well, actually, some of them are actually LOC agency hired.

asr-002890
03:26:08.240 --> 03:26:10.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: But I don't want to go there. Dole na yan eh.

asr-002891
03:26:10.240 --> 03:26:14.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: But ito lang, sir. I have a bill, 4225.

asr-002892
03:26:14.240 --> 03:26:19.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Which is the Philippine Banana Industry Development Act.

asr-002893
03:26:19.240 --> 03:26:28.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Once again, banana industry grew roughly almost a million indirect and direct workers.

asr-002894
03:26:28.240 --> 03:26:31.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I hope, please support it.

asr-002895
03:26:31.240 --> 03:26:35.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Kaya parang tatlong tulong naka-congresses ba?

asr-002896
03:26:35.240 --> 03:26:37.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Three congresses have passed.

asr-002897
03:26:37.240 --> 03:26:41.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And I also wish that this will be certified urgent, sir.

asr-002898
03:26:41.240 --> 03:26:42.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: House Bill 4245.

asr-002899
03:26:42.240 --> 03:26:43.240
