DA Undersecretary Asis G. Perez: additional revenue

asr-003092
03:39:38.330 --> 03:39:43.250
DA Undersecretary Asis G. Perez: if we can arrange the classification of jowl.

asr-003093
03:39:43.930 --> 03:39:44.650
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Mr. Chair, thank you.

asr-003094
03:39:44.650 --> 03:39:46.530
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Thank you for that clarification.

asr-003095
03:39:47.130 --> 03:39:48.470
Rep. Allan U. Ty: To the administrator,

asr-003096
03:39:49.610 --> 03:39:50.230
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Mr. Administrator,

asr-003097
03:39:50.250 --> 03:39:54.250
Rep. Allan U. Ty: can you confirm that National Irrigation Administration

asr-003098
03:39:54.250 --> 03:39:58.490
Rep. Allan U. Ty: is a government-owned and controlled corporation?

asr-003099
03:39:59.330 --> 03:39:59.690
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

asr-003100
03:39:59.890 --> 03:40:01.130
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA is a Jewish SEC.

asr-003101
03:40:02.210 --> 03:40:04.530
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA receives national government subsidies

asr-003102
03:40:04.530 --> 03:40:08.250
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: for development and construction rehabilitation

asr-003103
03:40:08.250 --> 03:40:11.970
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: for our national irrigation system.

asr-003104
03:40:13.550 --> 03:40:14.830
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It comes from GAA.

asr-003105
03:40:14.830 --> 03:40:15.350
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Okay.

asr-003106
03:40:16.290 --> 03:40:19.830
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, how do you spend your annual...

asr-003107
03:40:20.250 --> 03:40:23.330
Rep. Allan U. Ty: national government subsidy?

asr-003108
03:40:23.330 --> 03:40:26.650
Rep. Allan U. Ty: And how do you appropriate it and utilize it?

asr-003109
03:40:26.650 --> 03:40:29.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Well,

asr-003110
03:40:29.960 --> 03:40:32.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: this, Mr. Chair,

asr-003111
03:40:32.760 --> 03:40:36.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: we have evaluated our priorities,

asr-003112
03:40:36.560 --> 03:40:38.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: like what was explained earlier,

asr-003113
03:40:38.200 --> 03:40:39.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: our prioritization.

asr-003114
03:40:39.960 --> 03:40:45.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And then, we have identified in our budget,

asr-003115
03:40:45.880 --> 03:40:47.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: in a prexy form.

asr-003116
03:40:47.240 --> 03:40:48.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It used to be in a prexy form.

asr-003117
03:40:48.240 --> 03:40:50.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But now, we have a line item.

asr-003118
03:40:50.240 --> 03:40:51.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, in...

asr-003119
03:40:51.440 --> 03:40:56.040
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, in fiscal year 2025 and prior years,

asr-003120
03:40:56.040 --> 03:40:59.120
Rep. Allan U. Ty: was the NIA budget generally presented

asr-003121
03:40:59.120 --> 03:41:03.240
Rep. Allan U. Ty: under program expenditure classification or prexy?

asr-003122
03:41:03.240 --> 03:41:04.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: That's correct, Mr. Chair.

asr-003123
03:41:04.960 --> 03:41:05.880
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Or by major...

asr-003124
03:41:05.880 --> 03:41:07.560
Rep. Allan U. Ty: I'm not yet finished, Mr. Administrator,

asr-003125
03:41:07.560 --> 03:41:08.720
Rep. Allan U. Ty: my question. Yes, sir.

asr-003126
03:41:08.720 --> 03:41:11.760
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Or by major programs and sub-programs

asr-003127
03:41:11.760 --> 03:41:14.520
Rep. Allan U. Ty: without incorporating an extensive list

asr-003128
03:41:14.520 --> 03:41:19.820
Rep. Allan U. Ty: of individual irrigation projects in the NEP or GAA?

asr-003129
03:41:19.820 --> 03:41:21.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair, that's correct.

asr-003130
03:41:21.320 --> 03:41:24.000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But the detailed project list was submitted

asr-003131
03:41:24.000 --> 03:41:26.000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: as a supporting document.

asr-003132
03:41:26.000 --> 03:41:28.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But individual projects were generally

asr-003133
03:41:28.440 --> 03:41:31.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: not made separate line items in the NEP or the GAA annex,

asr-003134
03:41:31.920 --> 03:41:32.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair.

asr-003135
03:41:32.920 --> 03:41:35.160
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, it's under program expenditures,

asr-003136
03:41:35.160 --> 03:41:36.360
Rep. Allan U. Ty: program and sub-programs.

asr-003137
03:41:36.360 --> 03:41:37.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: By prexy portion.

asr-003138
03:41:37.920 --> 03:41:38.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes.

asr-003139
03:41:38.920 --> 03:41:39.920
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Program expenditure.

asr-003140
03:41:39.920 --> 03:41:41.080
Rep. Allan U. Ty: By prexy.

asr-003141
03:41:41.080 --> 03:41:42.080
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Okay.

asr-003142
03:41:42.080 --> 03:41:45.520
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, under this program-based framework,

asr-003143
03:41:45.520 --> 03:41:48.840
Rep. Allan U. Ty: was NIA still required to submit its proposed project list

asr-003144
03:41:48.840 --> 03:41:51.160
Rep. Allan U. Ty: and supporting documents to the DBM?

asr-003145
03:41:51.320 --> 03:41:56.320
Rep. Allan U. Ty: For technical evaluation, validation, and budget review?

asr-003146
03:41:56.320 --> 03:41:57.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-003147
03:41:57.320 --> 03:42:01.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Even under the program-based arrangement,

asr-003148
03:42:01.640 --> 03:42:04.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA submitted project lists and supporting documents

asr-003149
03:42:04.080 --> 03:42:06.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: to the DBM for evaluation.

asr-003150
03:42:06.600 --> 03:42:09.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The projects underwent technical validation,

asr-003151
03:42:09.840 --> 03:42:12.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: you know, prioritization,

asr-003152
03:42:12.840 --> 03:42:16.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: costing and assessment of implementation readiness.

asr-003153
03:42:16.560 --> 03:42:19.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The absence of individual line items in the GAA, Mr. Chair,

asr-003154
03:42:19.720 --> 03:42:20.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: did not mean...

asr-003155
03:42:21.320 --> 03:42:23.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: that the projects were unvalidated

asr-003156
03:42:23.520 --> 03:42:27.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: or that NIA had unlimited discretion.

asr-003157
03:42:27.240 --> 03:42:31.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, is it correct to say that it is subject to DBM evaluation,

asr-003158
03:42:31.760 --> 03:42:35.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: procurement laws, auditing rules, engineering standards,

asr-003159
03:42:35.320 --> 03:42:38.040
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and congressional oversight?

asr-003160
03:42:38.040 --> 03:42:41.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair, that's correct.

asr-003161
03:42:41.280 --> 03:42:42.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: A program-based budget, of course,

asr-003162
03:42:42.800 --> 03:42:45.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: does not remove accountability, Mr. Chair.

asr-003163
03:42:45.560 --> 03:42:49.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: All NIA projects remain submitted to...

asr-003164
03:42:49.440 --> 03:42:51.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: subject to DBM evaluation.

asr-003165
03:42:51.320 --> 03:42:53.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Like you said, government procurement laws,

asr-003166
03:42:53.640 --> 03:42:55.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: co-auditing requirements,

asr-003167
03:42:55.480 --> 03:42:58.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: approved engineering plans and technical specifications,

asr-003168
03:42:58.520 --> 03:43:01.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: environmental and other regulatory requirements,

asr-003169
03:43:01.880 --> 03:43:04.000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: monitoring and reporting to Congress.

asr-003170
03:43:04.000 --> 03:43:08.560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The flexibility, of course, Mr. Chair,

asr-003171
03:43:08.560 --> 03:43:11.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: because we sent a letter to the speaker

asr-003172
03:43:11.760 --> 03:43:16.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: for more flexibility, Mr. Chair.

asr-003173
03:43:16.520 --> 03:43:19.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It's not discretion, of course, without accountability.

asr-003174
03:43:19.440 --> 03:43:21.120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It is operational flexibility.

asr-003175
03:43:21.120 --> 03:43:24.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It is necessary to respond to actual field condition

asr-003176
03:43:24.280 --> 03:43:28.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: while remaining fully transparent and accountable.

asr-003177
03:43:28.600 --> 03:43:32.120
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Mr. Administrator, in the fiscal year 2026,

asr-003178
03:43:32.120 --> 03:43:34.280
Rep. Allan U. Ty: or this year, current year,

asr-003179
03:43:34.280 --> 03:43:39.080
Rep. Allan U. Ty: individual NIA projects were specifically itemized.

asr-003180
03:43:39.080 --> 03:43:43.280
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Based on your NIA's actual implementation experience,

asr-003181
03:43:43.280 --> 03:43:48.760
Rep. Allan U. Ty: what operational challenges resulted from this arrangement,

asr-003182
03:43:48.760 --> 03:43:50.960
Rep. Allan U. Ty: particularly with project costs,

asr-003183
03:43:51.120 --> 03:43:57.240
Rep. Allan U. Ty: right-of-way, emergencies, calamities, etc.?

asr-003184
03:43:57.240 --> 03:44:02.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Well, Mr. Chair, based on our 2026 implementation experience,

asr-003185
03:44:02.360 --> 03:44:05.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: making individual projects separate budget line items

asr-003186
03:44:05.640 --> 03:44:11.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: created significant operational difficulties, Mr. Chair.

asr-003187
03:44:11.880 --> 03:44:14.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Once a project is specifically itemized,

asr-003188
03:44:14.320 --> 03:44:18.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA has very limited flexibility to adjust the allocation,

asr-003189
03:44:18.360 --> 03:44:20.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: even when actual field conditions have changed.

asr-003190
03:44:20.480 --> 03:44:23.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair, for example, detailed engineering may reveal

asr-003191
03:44:23.960 --> 03:44:27.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: a different scope of project cost, right-of-way problems,

asr-003192
03:44:27.440 --> 03:44:31.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: permits, calamities, or other irrigation requirements

asr-003193
03:44:31.240 --> 03:44:34.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: may require immediate reprioritization.

asr-003194
03:44:34.960 --> 03:44:37.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: You know, a project initially proposed may subsequently

asr-003195
03:44:37.640 --> 03:44:41.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: encounter technical and legal implementation constraints

asr-003196
03:44:41.080 --> 03:44:45.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: because the appropriations are tied to specific line items.

asr-003197
03:44:45.960 --> 03:44:49.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Funds cannot be readily redirected to other validated

asr-003198
03:44:49.720 --> 03:44:53.440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and implementation-ready projects without going through

asr-003199
03:44:53.440 --> 03:44:59.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: a lengthy modification or realignment process, Mr. Chair.

asr-003200
03:44:59.160 --> 03:45:00.000
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, do you mean to tell—

asr-003221
03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:06.300
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Tell me, Mr. Administrator, that the list that you submitted to DBM

asr-003222
03:45:06.300 --> 03:45:10.400
Rep. Allan U. Ty: is only for the purpose of planning and validation documents

asr-003223
03:45:10.400 --> 03:45:16.440
Rep. Allan U. Ty: subject to final costing and implementation readiness assessment

asr-003224
03:45:16.440 --> 03:45:22.580
Rep. Allan U. Ty: rather than as a rigid statutory enumeration of projects?

asr-003225
03:45:24.400 --> 03:45:25.260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-003226
03:45:25.260 --> 03:45:34.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And, of course, you know, under the previous program-based system po kasi,

asr-003227
03:45:34.620 --> 03:45:38.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: if one project encountered an unavoidable delay,

asr-003228
03:45:39.040 --> 03:45:42.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA had greater flexibility subject to applicable rules

asr-003229
03:45:42.240 --> 03:45:46.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: to proceed with another validated, highly priority,

asr-003230
03:45:46.700 --> 03:45:51.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and implementable-ready project with the same program.

asr-003231
03:45:51.280 --> 03:45:54.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya, you know, lumiit po.

asr-003232
03:45:54.640 --> 03:45:59.500
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, humina po yung aming BUR, yung budget utilization rate po namin, Mr. Chair.

asr-003233
03:46:00.060 --> 03:46:01.660
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Because of the detailed list.

asr-003234
03:46:02.460 --> 03:46:04.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Napahirap po talaga ang implementation.

asr-003235
03:46:05.220 --> 03:46:07.300
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Do we have the representative of DBM?

asr-003236
03:46:10.530 --> 03:46:13.350
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Mr. Chairman, do we have a representative from DBM?

asr-003237
03:46:15.850 --> 03:46:17.950
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Meron na ba tayo dyan? From DBM?

asr-003238
03:46:29.000 --> 03:46:30.920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Any representative from DBM?

asr-003239
03:46:40.170 --> 03:46:40.430
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Yes.

asr-003240
03:46:42.270 --> 03:46:45.790
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Chairman Ilagan?

asr-003241
03:46:46.530 --> 03:46:48.530
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Director Ilagan?

asr-003242
03:46:59.060 --> 03:47:00.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Or any DBM representative?

asr-003243
03:47:21.220 --> 03:47:28.850
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Anyway, well, Mr. Administrator,

asr-003244
03:47:29.530 --> 03:47:36.070
Rep. Allan U. Ty: did you or did you not recommend the detailed list

asr-003245
03:47:36.070 --> 03:47:39.370
Rep. Allan U. Ty: of individual NIA projects to DBM?

asr-003246
03:47:40.150 --> 03:47:42.670
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Or was it DBM-imposed?

asr-003247
03:47:44.610 --> 03:47:45.990
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003248
03:47:46.250 --> 03:47:48.470
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The project list submitted during the budget preparation.

asr-003249
03:47:48.750 --> 03:47:51.050
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: We submitted, Mr. Chair.

asr-003250
03:47:51.170 --> 03:47:56.150
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But it should be considered as a planning, prioritization, and validation document,

asr-003251
03:47:56.850 --> 03:47:57.830
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Your Honor.

asr-003252
03:47:59.150 --> 03:48:02.910
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: You know, although projects undergo initial validation conditions,

asr-003253
03:48:03.010 --> 03:48:03.650
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: may change.

asr-003254
03:48:03.910 --> 03:48:04.490
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ano po ito eh?

asr-003255
03:48:04.730 --> 03:48:07.890
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Although naglagay po kami ng project list,

asr-003256
03:48:08.490 --> 03:48:13.170
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: of course, kung ano man po yung sistema ng paglagay ng DBM sa NEP,

asr-003257
03:48:14.090 --> 03:48:16.990
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: sa kanila pong discretion po yun, Mr. Chair.

asr-003258
03:48:17.430 --> 03:48:18.450
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, ibig ba po?

asr-003259
03:48:18.750 --> 03:48:22.230
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Ibig po bang sabihin, yung buong listahan na isinumit eh,

asr-003260
03:48:23.030 --> 03:48:26.250
Rep. Allan U. Ty: hindi ho lahat doon ay implementation ready?

asr-003261
03:48:27.470 --> 03:48:30.510
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Kung susumain sa sinasinabi mo?

asr-003262
03:48:32.090 --> 03:48:32.330
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yeah.

asr-003263
03:48:32.810 --> 03:48:33.030
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yeah.

asr-003264
03:48:34.030 --> 03:48:36.410
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: We submitted, Mr. Chair, again, but

asr-003265
03:48:36.410 --> 03:48:41.230
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: for technical evaluation.

asr-003266
03:48:41.370 --> 03:48:42.790
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi ina-evaluate po nila yan eh.

asr-003267
03:48:43.130 --> 03:48:43.810
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung aming ano.

asr-003268
03:48:43.810 --> 03:48:44.890
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And of course,

asr-003269
03:48:45.490 --> 03:48:47.810
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: our implementation experience,

asr-003270
03:48:48.750 --> 03:48:52.310
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: nevertheless, shows that incorporating the entire list

asr-003271
03:48:52.310 --> 03:48:56.850
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: as rigid budget line items creates operational constraints po

asr-003272
03:48:56.850 --> 03:49:00.250
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and adversely affects timely implementation of our BUR.

asr-003273
03:49:00.850 --> 03:49:04.050
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: There is no consistency, Mr. Chair, in our position.

asr-003274
03:49:04.230 --> 03:49:08.250
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: We support submitting a complete and validated project list.

asr-003275
03:49:08.330 --> 03:49:12.770
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But we recommend that the appropriation itself remain program-based under PLEXI.

asr-003276
03:49:13.510 --> 03:49:17.750
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, that is based on your experience in implementing the fiscal year 2026 project?

asr-003277
03:49:17.750 --> 03:49:18.070
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Yes.

asr-003278
03:49:18.750 --> 03:49:19.890
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Am I correct?

asr-003279
03:49:20.390 --> 03:49:23.650
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Napakahirap po mag-implement kasi talagang, you know,

asr-003280
03:49:24.190 --> 03:49:27.930
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pagka, for example, Mr. Chair, yung aming

asr-003281
03:49:27.930 --> 03:49:30.910
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: mga soropop irrigation project,

asr-003282
03:49:31.030 --> 03:49:36.170
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pagka hindi na sapat yung tubig doon sa aming test run,

asr-003283
03:49:36.510 --> 03:49:38.550
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: hindi na hoon amin basta yun maililipat.

asr-003284
03:49:38.670 --> 03:49:41.330
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi may naka-JOT agpo siya.

asr-003285
03:49:41.970 --> 03:49:44.090
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So, base po sa sinabi nyo,

asr-003286
03:49:44.090 --> 03:49:48.090
Rep. Allan U. Ty: what, which budget structure

asr-003287
03:49:48.750 --> 03:49:49.450
Rep. Allan U. Ty: do you prefer?

asr-003288
03:49:50.310 --> 03:49:55.170
Rep. Allan U. Ty: A rigid itemized project listing in the GAA as annex

asr-003289
03:49:55.170 --> 03:49:59.930
Rep. Allan U. Ty: or a program-based appropriations under program expenditure classification

asr-003290
03:49:59.930 --> 03:50:05.410
Rep. Allan U. Ty: supported by a separately submitted, validated, and transparent project list?

asr-003291
03:50:05.950 --> 03:50:08.210
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Under PLEXI, Mr. Chair,

asr-003292
03:50:08.390 --> 03:50:11.190
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: restoring the program-based PLEXI structure would provide...

asr-003293
03:50:11.190 --> 03:50:12.670
