asr-005299
05:06:06.420 --> 05:06:18.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is it based on number of farmers, agricultural production, hectares served, commodities, connectivity to markets, poverty incidents, or other measurable criteria?

asr-005300
05:06:19.420 --> 05:06:28.300
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, meron tayong yung tinatawag na, Mr. Chair, na road influence area, poverty incidents, number of farmers or fisherfolk beneficiaries,

asr-005301
05:06:28.320 --> 05:06:40.060
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: distance to network links, present road conditions, climate change adaptation, average daily traffic, plus new production areas, Mr. Chair.

asr-005302
05:06:40.300 --> 05:06:55.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasama na din po dyan ba yung parang ROI? So when we invest in a farm-to-market road, yung economic activity based on our production, and yung balik po sa gobyerno?

asr-005303
05:06:56.420 --> 05:06:57.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Well, in general...

asr-005304
05:06:58.320 --> 05:07:14.960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: In general, we do that practice, but on real applications, hindi naman palahat ganon, kasi meron talagang tinatawag na missionary routes or missionary area na sobrang hirap, na konti production, pero ang laki ng potential.

asr-005305
05:07:15.820 --> 05:07:23.740
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So you have to open it up, you have to put the road, and the benefits come later, lalo na sa poverty areas, Mr. Chair.

asr-005306
05:07:24.460 --> 05:07:28.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you tell us, Mr. Chair, ilan po bang kilometro?

asr-005307
05:07:28.320 --> 05:07:31.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan po bang kilometro ang ideal na dapat fina-fund natin annually?

asr-005308
05:07:31.980 --> 05:07:41.940
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ah, kung akong tatanungin, Mr. Chair, maybe 60 billion a year?

asr-005309
05:07:42.720 --> 05:07:44.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 60 billion for FMRs?

asr-005310
05:07:44.520 --> 05:07:45.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-005311
05:07:45.120 --> 05:07:54.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And how many roads will that build? In terms of kilometers, ilan po, dun sa 55,000 kilometer deficit natin, ilan po ang magagawa nun sa isang taon?

asr-005312
05:07:54.880 --> 05:07:56.400
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ah, 4,000 kilometers.

asr-005313
05:07:56.860 --> 05:07:59.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So ideally, yan po ang bare minimum?

asr-005314
05:07:59.460 --> 05:07:59.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bare minimum.

asr-005315
05:08:00.620 --> 05:08:04.340
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Bare minimum yan para in 10, 12 years tapos, Mr. Chair.

asr-005316
05:08:06.560 --> 05:08:14.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit po hindi yun ang, bakit po hindi yun ang hiningi natin sa, yun ang inindicate natin sa NEP?

asr-005317
05:08:15.820 --> 05:08:24.380
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Fiscal space, Mr. Chair. We were told na ito lang ang fiscal space na binibigay sa amin sa initial NEP namin, Mr. Chair.

asr-005318
05:08:25.560 --> 05:08:31.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chair, nabanggit niyo po, Mr. Secretary, na ang DA can,

asr-005319
05:08:32.000 --> 05:08:35.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: construct FMRs at a lower cost than DPWH.

asr-005320
05:08:37.120 --> 05:08:44.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kaya niyo po ba talaga yan? And currently, can DA demonstrate it in terms of its absorptive capacity?

asr-005321
05:08:45.500 --> 05:08:48.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And do you have the manpower to do it?

asr-005322
05:08:49.360 --> 05:09:01.400
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: For this year, we are, sa 33 billion na aming budget this year, we have allocated 30% muna ang gagawin ng DA.

asr-005323
05:09:02.000 --> 05:09:05.380
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dahil nga sa absorptive capacity and manpower restrictions.

asr-005324
05:09:05.680 --> 05:09:11.040
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But next year, we are more ready. And of course, the year after, we will be more ready, Mr. Chair.

asr-005325
05:09:11.480 --> 05:09:14.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Mr. Secretary and Mr. Chair.

asr-005326
05:09:15.620 --> 05:09:28.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: To the NIA, Mr. Chair, may I ask the Administrator, we noticed a significant change in your fiscal year 2026 NIA budget.

asr-005327
05:09:30.140 --> 05:09:33.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Projects became much more specifically itemized.

asr-005328
05:09:33.400 --> 05:09:40.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And special provision number 8 was added, restricting modifications to the project list.

asr-005329
05:09:41.940 --> 05:09:47.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Did these changes, Mr. Chair, help NIA implement its budget better?

asr-005330
05:09:48.660 --> 05:09:52.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Or did they somehow contribute to the drop in your utilization?

asr-005331
05:09:53.900 --> 05:09:57.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What was the actual effect dun po sa inyong implementation?

asr-005332
05:10:00.490 --> 05:10:01.670
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-005333
05:10:02.150 --> 05:10:05.050
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually, bumaba po yung VOR natin.

asr-005334
05:10:05.070 --> 05:10:20.190
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ano po, yung budget utilization rate natin ay bumaba po dahil napaka-strict, napaka-stringent po yung special provisions.

asr-005335
05:10:23.030 --> 05:10:30.070
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, based on your experience, ano hong budget structure ang ire-recommend nyo sa Kongreso?

asr-005336
05:10:31.730 --> 05:10:35.050
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That will still preserve transparency and accountability.

asr-005337
05:10:35.070 --> 05:10:39.530
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero hindi po maaantala yung inyong implementation.

asr-005338
05:10:41.090 --> 05:10:50.910
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Well, Sir, Sir Chair, based on our experience, NIA prefers a program-based appropriation under PREC-C.

asr-005339
05:10:51.310 --> 05:10:58.230
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung gaya po ng dati, before 2026, yung 2025 and prior, ganoon po kasi dati.

asr-005340
05:10:58.230 --> 05:11:04.230
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But, of course, it will still be supported by detailed, validated, and transparent.

asr-005341
05:11:05.070 --> 05:11:09.330
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: A project list submitted separately, of course, to Congress and DBM.

asr-005342
05:11:10.090 --> 05:11:11.510
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Magsasubmit pa rin po kami dun, ano po.

asr-005343
05:11:13.570 --> 05:11:22.670
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang maganda po dito, this arrangement, ano po, provides the best balance between transparency and accountability.

asr-005344
05:11:24.470 --> 05:11:26.790
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Congressional and DBM oversight.

asr-005345
05:11:28.190 --> 05:11:34.790
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Lalong-lalo na po yung implementation flexibility, ano po, and responsiveness to actual field conditions.

asr-005346
05:11:35.070 --> 05:11:40.490
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And yung timely and efficient utilization ng aming mga projects.

asr-005347
05:11:41.270 --> 05:11:46.650
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually, this does not give NIA unlimited authority po to replace projects.

asr-005348
05:11:47.510 --> 05:11:56.270
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Any adjustment must remain within the approved program and comply with budgeting, procurement, and auditing and reporting requirements.

asr-005349
05:11:56.270 --> 05:12:04.890
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ang sinasabi nyo po, based on your previous experience, bago po i-implement yung Special Provision No. 8,

asr-005350
05:12:05.070 --> 05:12:07.610
Rep. Roberto Nazal: wala po kayo naging problema sa utilization nyo.

asr-005351
05:12:08.150 --> 05:12:14.450
Rep. Roberto Nazal: At madali kayong, mas nagkaroon kayo ng elbow room para i-implement yung projects.

asr-005352
05:12:15.250 --> 05:12:18.990
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair. Tingnan nyo po, lalo na po ito.

asr-005353
05:12:19.210 --> 05:12:21.710
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: You have to understand po yung situation ng NIA.

asr-005354
05:12:22.550 --> 05:12:27.710
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: For previous years, minsan wala kaming QRF.

asr-005355
05:12:28.250 --> 05:12:30.750
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Minsan, ngayon, 300 po ang QRF po natin.

asr-005356
05:12:30.750 --> 05:12:33.290
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: E papasok po tayo sa LNU.

asr-005357
05:12:33.750 --> 05:12:34.990
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ngayon, minsan.

asr-005358
05:12:35.070 --> 05:12:41.410
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At pag may bumaha, bumagyo, merong na-wash out na irrigation canal namin, may standing crop,

asr-005359
05:12:41.850 --> 05:12:43.190
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: halos hindi kami makagalaw eh.

asr-005360
05:12:43.270 --> 05:12:46.410
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi namin magalaw ngayon yung aming repair and restoration.

asr-005361
05:12:47.090 --> 05:12:54.030
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, minsan naman po kasi, may mga projects po ang NIA na although okay naman siya nung in-identify namin,

asr-005362
05:12:54.030 --> 05:12:56.770
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: kaya lang nung pag-implement, nagkaroon ng problema.

asr-005363
05:12:57.250 --> 05:13:02.070
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kagaya po ng aming mga solar pump irrigation projects na groundwater ang source.

asr-005364
05:13:03.250 --> 05:13:05.030
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Totoo nga pong nag-replace.

asr-005365
05:13:05.070 --> 05:13:07.350
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nag-gumagawa kayo namin ng georesistivity.

asr-005366
05:13:07.510 --> 05:13:08.670
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May tubig, nakikita namin.

asr-005367
05:13:09.130 --> 05:13:12.410
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya lang pag-drill mo, minsan may tatama ang bato na malalaki.

asr-005368
05:13:13.010 --> 05:13:14.250
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan namin ilipat.

asr-005369
05:13:14.370 --> 05:13:17.730
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, imagine our predicament kung naka-geotag yun.

asr-005370
05:13:18.170 --> 05:13:19.450
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Eh, kailangan mo lang ilipat.

asr-005371
05:13:19.570 --> 05:13:21.090
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi magiging ghost project siya eh.

asr-005372
05:13:21.350 --> 05:13:23.450
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pag wala siya dun sa georesistivity.

asr-005373
05:13:23.670 --> 05:13:27.450
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan lamang po namin ng kaunting flexibility rin po.

asr-005374
05:13:27.650 --> 05:13:34.470
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ano ho naging limitasyon na nakastipulate dun sa special provision number 8 na nalimita kayo?

asr-005375
05:13:34.470 --> 05:13:37.910
Rep. Roberto Nazal: At hindi nyo nagamit, hindi naging usable yung project?

asr-005376
05:13:40.860 --> 05:13:42.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May coming experience, Mr. Chair.

asr-005377
05:13:42.600 --> 05:13:44.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Like, again, yung in-explain ko sa inyo kanina.

asr-005378
05:13:44.640 --> 05:13:51.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And, for some reason, alimbawa po yung budget namin ngayon, across the board, na nagbawas.

asr-005379
05:13:51.340 --> 05:13:53.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi may naging problema sa highways.

asr-005380
05:13:53.600 --> 05:13:55.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pati kami, nabawasan yung aming budget.

asr-005381
05:13:56.800 --> 05:13:59.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero hindi naman nabawasan yung nakalagay na line item.

asr-005382
05:13:59.420 --> 05:14:06.140
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: For example, construction of 100 meters irrigation canal.

asr-005383
05:14:06.680 --> 05:14:08.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At, say, 10 million.

asr-005384
05:14:08.700 --> 05:14:09.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ginawa po siyang 5 million.

asr-005385
05:14:09.980 --> 05:14:13.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The same pa rin yung nakalagay po sa line item eh.

asr-005386
05:14:14.000 --> 05:14:17.020
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, ang dilemma namin po ngayon, paano mo i-implement yun?

asr-005387
05:14:17.100 --> 05:14:19.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Eh, binawasan ka ng budget, the same pa rin yun.

asr-005388
05:14:19.200 --> 05:14:22.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, mas maganda po sana talaga kung nakaprexy lamang siya.

asr-005389
05:14:22.880 --> 05:14:24.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Para kahit bawasan kami ng budget,

asr-005390
05:14:24.780 --> 05:14:29.120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang gagawin lang namin, i-discontinue namin yung ibang projects.

asr-005391
05:14:29.120 --> 05:14:33.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Para, you know, kailangan po namin mag-early procurement eh.

asr-005392
05:14:33.680 --> 05:14:36.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: With this, with what happened,

asr-005393
05:14:36.680 --> 05:14:39.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: na bale wala po lahat yung early procurement namin

asr-005394
05:14:39.740 --> 05:14:42.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: at wala kaming ginawa kundi mag-modify ng project.

asr-005395
05:14:42.820 --> 05:14:45.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, lalong delayed na nga kami na wala nang early procurement,

asr-005396
05:14:46.260 --> 05:14:48.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: wala pa kaming ginawa kundi mag-modify ng project.

asr-005397
05:14:48.420 --> 05:14:51.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, affected po ang implementation ng project.

asr-005398
05:14:52.460 --> 05:14:53.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And one more thing, Mr. Chair, ano po,

asr-005399
05:14:54.000 --> 05:14:57.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: hindi po kami kagaya ng DPWX na any time of the year

asr-005400
05:14:57.240 --> 05:14:58.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pwede mag-implement ng project.

asr-005401
05:14:59.100 --> 05:14:59.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kami po,

asr-005402
05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:06.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pagka-ungoing yung irrigation namin ng kanals sa mga palayan, hindi namin pwedeng galawin yung aming kanal.

asr-005403
05:15:06.880 --> 05:15:08.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So kailangan po namin i-timing talaga.

asr-005404
05:15:08.820 --> 05:15:11.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Habang ginagamit po yung tubig, hindi pwedeng gumawa?

asr-005405
05:15:11.820 --> 05:15:14.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Habang ginagamit po, hindi ka pwedeng gumawa sa irrigation kanal.

asr-005406
05:15:15.760 --> 05:15:25.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you submit a proposal to this committee kung ano po yung mga special provisions na gusto niyong i-indicate?

asr-005407
05:15:25.100 --> 05:15:34.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: At ano yung proposal niyo in terms of yung, paano yung gusto niyong implementation para maintindihan po namin prior to plenary?

asr-005408
05:15:35.180 --> 05:15:39.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung dati po na recommendation, actually kahit itanong natin ang DBM po,

asr-005409
05:15:40.700 --> 05:15:45.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung by prexy lamang po sana, program expenditure, ganun lang po sana ang natin.

asr-005410
05:15:45.980 --> 05:15:53.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Although yung line items namin, nandoon pa rin po, i-identify pa rin namin lahat, pero hindi siya naka-line item sa GAA.

asr-005411
05:15:53.280 --> 05:15:55.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pag-release ng SARO, doon siya.

asr-005412
05:15:55.100 --> 05:15:58.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nandoon siya. Para kung may changes, kaya nga po kami GOCC eh.

asr-005413
05:15:59.220 --> 05:16:06.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Because GOCCs are allowed po na i-change namin yung project namin through sa aming board.

asr-005414
05:16:07.060 --> 05:16:09.220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pag line agency ka, pupunta ka kay presidente.

asr-005415
05:16:09.600 --> 05:16:12.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you submit that in writing, Mr. Chair?

asr-005416
05:16:12.100 --> 05:16:12.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-005417
05:16:13.220 --> 05:16:19.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tapos nabanggit niyo rin po, Mr. Chair, ni Administrator, na nabawasan kayo.

asr-005418
05:16:19.380 --> 05:16:24.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When an irrigation project po is designed and costed at a certain amount,

asr-005419
05:16:25.100 --> 05:16:29.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: but Congress substantially cuts that particular line item,

asr-005420
05:16:30.040 --> 05:16:31.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ano po ang nangyayari doon sa project?

asr-005421
05:16:32.380 --> 05:16:36.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can the remaining amount still deliver the intended functional output?

asr-005422
05:16:37.020 --> 05:16:38.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Gaganap pa rin po ba yung project?

asr-005423
05:16:38.820 --> 05:16:46.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Or ang nangyayari po ba ay if we end up with an incomplete irrigation project, hindi na natin ito magagamit?

asr-005424
05:16:47.380 --> 05:16:54.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair, just to be clear, hindi po kami magtuturo kung saan nabawasan.

asr-005425
05:16:55.100 --> 05:16:59.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang totoo naman yan, pag nandito kami sa Kongreso, dinadagdagan nyo naman yung budget natin.

asr-005426
05:16:59.860 --> 05:17:04.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But, you know, ang dilemma po kasi ng NIA, parang pag gumawa ka ng isang dam,

asr-005427
05:17:04.860 --> 05:17:08.020
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: hindi naman po pwede na bawasan mo yung dam kasi hindi mo matatapos siya.

asr-005428
05:17:08.420 --> 05:17:11.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung isang maliit na gap sa dam na yan, pwedeng ikasira ng buong system.

asr-005429
05:17:12.380 --> 05:17:16.620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi po katulad ng kalsada, na kung magkano lang yung budget, hanggang doon ka lang.

asr-005430
05:17:16.620 --> 05:17:19.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa mga projects po ng NIA, hindi po pwede yung ganoon, Mr. Chair.

asr-005431
05:17:20.080 --> 05:17:24.120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya dapat hindi mo talaga siya gagalawin kung ano yung in-identify ng NIA.

asr-005432
05:17:24.540 --> 05:17:25.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Naalam namin.

asr-005433
05:17:25.100 --> 05:17:27.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi na magtatapos doon sa budget, sa project po.

asr-005434
05:17:28.040 --> 05:17:31.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan po yung mga projects na priority project, katulad ng mga binabanggit nyo,

asr-005435
05:17:31.960 --> 05:17:35.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na nabawasan na ang nangyari hindi na natin nagamit last year?

asr-005436
05:17:37.380 --> 05:17:39.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Last year, halos lahat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-005437
05:17:39.840 --> 05:17:41.400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil hindi nga po kami nakapreksi.

asr-005438
05:17:41.960 --> 05:17:44.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Siyempre kung magbabawas na ano yan, across the board yan.

asr-005439
05:17:44.760 --> 05:17:47.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, halos lahat po nagalaw yung aming budget.

asr-005440
05:17:48.040 --> 05:17:54.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, Mr. Chair, hindi naman po pwedeng kalahating dam or kalahating irrigation system ang pupondohan natin.

asr-005441
05:17:54.180 --> 05:17:58.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kaya, when we make adjustments here in the House, or later in the Senate,

asr-005442
05:17:59.560 --> 05:18:04.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I would just like to manifest that we have to consider the implementability of these projects,

asr-005443
05:18:04.880 --> 05:18:07.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: not simply the amount that we want to cut.

asr-005444
05:18:09.820 --> 05:18:12.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: My next question, I'd like to go to BIFAR.

asr-005445
05:18:13.960 --> 05:18:21.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chair, in 2024, BIFAR left 3.63 billion unobligated.

asr-005446
05:18:21.660 --> 05:18:22.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Gentle reminder.

asr-005447
05:18:24.180 --> 05:18:29.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 1.102 billion in unused cash was reverted to the Treasury,

asr-005448
05:18:30.000 --> 05:18:34.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and capital outlay utilization was only 21.54%.

asr-005449
05:18:34.240 --> 05:18:41.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: According to COA, the underutilization was mainly because projects were not implementation ready.

asr-005450
05:18:42.940 --> 05:18:47.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dahil dito, maraming benepisyo ang hindi nakarating sa fisher folk,

asr-005451
05:18:48.680 --> 05:18:51.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: boats, fishing gears, and safety equipment.

asr-005452
05:18:53.360 --> 05:18:54.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Aquaculture infrastructure.

asr-005453
05:18:54.160 --> 05:18:58.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Inputs, hatcheries, post-harvest facilities, fishery equipment, at livelihood assistance.

asr-005454
05:18:59.340 --> 05:19:06.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: At habang nasa BIFAR ang pera, hindi rin natin ito nailaan sa ibang programa na ready nang i-implement.

asr-005455
05:19:07.340 --> 05:19:17.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yet, BIFAR is asking Congress for 12.412 billion for 2027, including 3.61.4 billion in capital outlay.

asr-005456
05:19:19.060 --> 05:19:21.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit naman po natin sila bibigyan uli?

asr-005457
05:19:21.180 --> 05:19:23.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What has changed that should give Congress confidence?

asr-005458
05:19:24.160 --> 05:19:26.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That you can actually implement this budget?

asr-005459
05:19:27.340 --> 05:19:31.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And what are your obligation in disbursement rates for 2026 as of today?

asr-005460
05:19:34.150 --> 05:19:37.630
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair. Good afternoon, Your Honors.

asr-005461
05:19:38.230 --> 05:19:43.930
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: I am Zaldi Perez, Assistant Director for Administrative Services of the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources.

asr-005462
05:19:44.610 --> 05:19:53.430
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: Please be informed, Your Honors, that the 2024 project was delayed because of, of course,

asr-005463
05:19:53.430 --> 05:19:55.750
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: yung bidding process po natin.

asr-005464
05:19:55.950 --> 05:20:03.730
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: It took us some time to prepare the terms of reference as well as the specifications of these boats,

asr-005465
05:20:04.130 --> 05:20:11.510
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: which comprise po yung 50-meter vessels, 80-meter vessels, and then the 62-footer boats, Your Honors.

asr-005466
05:20:11.990 --> 05:20:14.350
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: So that's why po nadelay ng konti.

asr-005467
05:20:14.470 --> 05:20:21.170
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: It's because I think po nabid po namin siya later part na po ng 2024.

asr-005468
05:20:21.170 --> 05:20:25.830
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: But it was successfully bidded out.

asr-005469
05:20:25.950 --> 05:20:31.330
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: And then we obligated po preceding year po, which is 2025.

asr-005470
05:20:32.510 --> 05:20:36.770
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: So all this project po is already ongoing right now.

asr-005471
05:20:37.170 --> 05:20:42.450
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: And there is already a partial delivery of this patrol, of this 62-footer.

asr-005472
05:20:42.830 --> 05:20:49.170
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: While that 50-meter and 80-meter is still under construction, Your Honors.

asr-005473
05:20:49.970 --> 05:20:52.050
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you just submit a list, Mr. Chair?

asr-005474
05:20:52.050 --> 05:20:55.930
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Magpapasubmit lang po ako ng list of projects na kukompletuhin nila for 2024.

asr-005475
05:20:55.950 --> 05:20:59.790
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay, pakisubmit na lang yung list na hinihingi ni Congresman.

asr-005476
05:20:59.790 --> 05:21:00.610
BIFAR Assistant Director for Administrative Services Zaldi Perez: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-005477
05:21:00.610 --> 05:21:01.370
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-005478
05:21:01.810 --> 05:21:02.150
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you.

asr-005479
05:21:02.270 --> 05:21:07.210
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you very much, Congresman Robert, the next interpollator from majority.

asr-005480
05:21:08.350 --> 05:21:14.190
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The famous and pinakasikat sa Kongreso,

asr-005481
05:21:15.450 --> 05:21:20.070
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Plum Cagayan Diuro, Representative Ropos Rodriguez.

asr-005482
05:21:20.570 --> 05:21:22.870
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Mr. Chairman, for those kind words.

asr-005483
05:21:22.870 --> 05:21:25.710
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And let me now, therefore,

asr-005484
05:21:25.950 --> 05:21:30.990
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: thank Secretary Kiko Laurel and the undersecretaries.

asr-005485
05:21:31.090 --> 05:21:38.190
