asr-005486
05:21:38.650 --> 05:21:43.470
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Nagsalita na rin si Yusek Oliveros, Yusek Perez, and the others also.

asr-005487
05:21:43.870 --> 05:21:45.150
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So thank you, number one.

asr-005488
05:21:45.250 --> 05:21:48.050
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I have this letter on August 28, 2025.

asr-005489
05:21:48.270 --> 05:21:52.630
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I ask you for cacao, coffee seedlings, durian, longko, etc.

asr-005490
05:21:52.630 --> 05:21:55.590
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Your regional director delivered double.

asr-005491
05:21:55.950 --> 05:21:57.950
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Then what I ask, thank you very much.

asr-005492
05:21:58.510 --> 05:22:02.990
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And that is the great, the dedicated, Roger Pacamalad.

asr-005493
