Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Where is Roger?

asr-005494
05:22:05.410 --> 05:22:06.410
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Can you stand up for the camera?

asr-005495
05:22:08.700 --> 05:22:10.340
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: O, camera, pakikuhan nilang kay Roger.

asr-005496
05:22:11.520 --> 05:22:13.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Apollo, Apollo, Apollo.

asr-005497
05:22:13.300 --> 05:22:15.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Apollo Pacamalad, doble sila eh, mga friends ko.

asr-005498
05:22:17.120 --> 05:22:21.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Also, Mr. Chairman, I ask also for farm-to-market roads.

asr-005499
05:22:21.400 --> 05:22:24.240
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And again, you gave double to what I asked, the additional.

asr-005500
05:22:24.480 --> 05:22:25.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much.

asr-005501
05:22:27.460 --> 05:22:30.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, it's true.

asr-005502
05:22:30.840 --> 05:22:31.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You gave me more.

asr-005503
05:22:32.680 --> 05:22:40.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, my question is, Mr. Secretary, what is now the share of Mindanao, six regions, six regions?

asr-005504
05:22:40.640 --> 05:22:49.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because last hearing, also August 28, 2025, our share was only 12%, and you promised that it will reach 20%.

asr-005505
05:22:49.460 --> 05:22:55.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because Mindanao gives 40% of our food requirements.

asr-005506
05:22:55.100 --> 05:22:57.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: With our corn, 70%.

asr-005507
05:22:57.460 --> 05:22:59.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: With our pineapple, 80%.

asr-005508
05:22:59.680 --> 05:23:01.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Banana, 60%.

asr-005509
05:23:01.620 --> 05:23:02.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And other crops.

asr-005510
05:23:05.640 --> 05:23:07.880
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The time is continued, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005511
05:23:08.340 --> 05:23:10.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Can we have the return three seconds?

asr-005512
05:23:13.970 --> 05:23:19.530
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Mr. Chair, mas malaki siya since last year, but still 11% pa lang.

asr-005513
05:23:21.510 --> 05:23:22.030
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Bumaba.

asr-005514
05:23:22.790 --> 05:23:23.870
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Bumaba kung 11.

asr-005515
05:23:24.050 --> 05:23:25.070
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 12 na kami last year.

asr-005516
05:23:25.450 --> 05:23:26.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: No, no, sorry, sorry.

asr-005517
05:23:26.650 --> 05:23:28.810
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Mali sinabi sa akin, kinokorek na.

asr-005518
05:23:28.930 --> 05:23:29.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 20%.

asr-005519
05:23:29.470 --> 05:23:34.410
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Kasi we expect Mindanao is the food basket of our country, and I am in Mindanao.

asr-005520
05:23:34.430 --> 05:23:34.790
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 20%, Mr. Chair.

asr-005521
05:23:34.990 --> 05:23:36.090
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, how much is that?

asr-005522
05:23:36.110 --> 05:23:37.310
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 20%, Mr. Chair.

asr-005523
05:23:37.710 --> 05:23:38.350
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 20 daw.

asr-005524
05:23:38.830 --> 05:23:39.790
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 20% na?

asr-005525
05:23:40.090 --> 05:23:40.990
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Are you sure?

asr-005526
05:23:41.270 --> 05:23:44.250
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We thank the Secretary and the entire DA family.

asr-005527
05:23:44.770 --> 05:23:51.430
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, I'd like to ask Yusek, Yusek Aray, Yusek Navarro, and Yusek Ching Bernos to say something.

asr-005528
05:23:57.080 --> 05:23:58.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yeah, your request to Congress.

asr-005529
05:24:11.460 --> 05:24:12.140
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Thank you.

asr-005530
05:24:12.140 --> 05:24:12.160
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: ...

asr-005531
05:24:12.180 --> 05:24:12.660
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Thank you, Kong.

asr-005532
05:24:12.800 --> 05:24:13.400
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Thank you, Chairman.

asr-005533
05:24:15.520 --> 05:24:24.600
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Undersecretary for Infrastructure of the Department of Agriculture, of course, we definitely need augmentation for FMRs.

asr-005534
05:24:24.720 --> 05:24:39.720
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: As clearly mentioned by Representative Nasalo, that we badly needed more roads, particularly for our farms.

asr-005535
05:24:39.720 --> 05:24:41.960
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: So, on target.

asr-005536
05:24:42.180 --> 05:24:51.440
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: So, what we want is not just 1,000, which is 16 billion for this year, but hopefully, for next year, hopefully we can triple that.

asr-005537
05:24:51.640 --> 05:24:54.740
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Kasi nga, the balance is 55,000.

asr-005538
05:24:55.440 --> 05:25:01.940
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Malayo pa po ang ano, napakalayo para mabawasan natin yung gap.

asr-005539
05:25:01.940 --> 05:25:11.960
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: So, so far po, at least yun, kung may ibigay sa amin, additional 2,000 kilometers, equivalent to 30 billion, that would be much appreciated.

asr-005540
05:25:12.180 --> 05:25:12.900
DA Undersecretary for Agro-Marine Industrial Systems Arrey A. Perez: Mr. Chairman.

asr-005541
05:25:13.200 --> 05:25:13.880
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-005542
05:25:14.000 --> 05:25:15.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: With our chairman, we approve your request.

asr-005543
05:25:15.900 --> 05:25:16.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Triple it.

asr-005544
05:25:17.080 --> 05:25:17.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-005545
05:25:18.420 --> 05:25:19.180
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Si Yusek Roger.

asr-005546
05:25:23.150 --> 05:25:24.830
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Maraming salamat po, Kong.

asr-005547
05:25:27.070 --> 05:25:32.010
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Ang alam naman po natin na kailangan talaga natin yung post-harvest facility, no?

asr-005548
05:25:32.630 --> 05:25:35.210
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Not only dryers, but also cold storages.

asr-005549
05:25:35.470 --> 05:25:41.090
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Kasi ang nakita namin, in terms of losses for post-harvest facility across all commodities,

asr-005550
05:25:41.250 --> 05:25:42.830
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: sa abot tayo ng mga 250 billion.

asr-005551
05:25:43.810 --> 05:25:45.370
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: 250 billion po, every year.

asr-005552
05:25:45.970 --> 05:25:49.070
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: So, you can just imagine kung 250 billion yun.

asr-005553
05:25:49.190 --> 05:25:55.890
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Kung ma-frontload lang natin yung 250 billion, and then we can construct a post-harvest facility all over the country,

asr-005554
05:25:56.370 --> 05:26:05.110
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: baka mawala na yung importation natin, kasi ma-address na natin yung quality, at saka stability of supply, and of course, stability of price.

asr-005555
05:26:05.550 --> 05:26:09.870
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: So, sana po, ma-increase lang natin yung ating post-harvest budget.

asr-005556
05:26:09.870 --> 05:26:11.630
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: By how much, Yusek Navarro?

asr-005557
05:26:11.630 --> 05:26:13.630
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: This time around, kasi nandyan.

asr-005558
05:26:13.810 --> 05:26:18.430
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Nandyan lang tayo sa mga post-harvest na kalagay kasi rito, sir.

asr-005559
05:26:18.530 --> 05:26:22.190
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Lalo na sa aming NFA, 11 lang tayo ngayon, no?

asr-005560
05:26:22.630 --> 05:26:23.510
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: How much?

asr-005561
05:26:25.850 --> 05:26:30.490
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: We are proposing for 2027, Yusek, around 6.5 billion.

asr-005562
05:26:32.150 --> 05:26:34.890
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Dapat, nandun tayo, double yan, sir.

asr-005563
05:26:35.290 --> 05:26:36.930
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Sa rice lang kasi yan, eh.

asr-005564
05:26:37.310 --> 05:26:39.390
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Ang gusto kasi natin, mayroon pang corn.

asr-005565
05:26:39.990 --> 05:26:41.630
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Eh, ako kasi yung corn ni sir.

asr-005566
05:26:42.130 --> 05:26:43.990
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: So, kailangan natin yung budget.

asr-005567
05:26:43.990 --> 05:26:45.110
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Can we ask, Mr. Chairman?

asr-005568
05:26:45.250 --> 05:26:48.950
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Everybody to just keep silent because these are very important.

asr-005569
05:26:49.630 --> 05:26:52.950
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: The statements of our Undersecretaries, very, very important, post-harvest.

asr-005570
05:26:53.490 --> 05:26:54.290
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005571
05:26:54.290 --> 05:26:55.070
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Ito, ito.

asr-005572
05:26:56.070 --> 05:26:59.930
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Yeah, ah, anyway, ah, yun yung request namin, sir.

asr-005573
05:27:00.070 --> 05:27:05.570
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: And then, ah, of course, ah, nagpapasalamat din kami sa support for the program.

asr-005574
05:27:05.850 --> 05:27:07.710
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: May increase lang natin ng mga 50%.

asr-005575
05:27:07.710 --> 05:27:13.050
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Sana yung, ah, yung budget natin, ah, this year and next year.

asr-005576
05:27:13.150 --> 05:27:15.230
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: In the next, ah, two more years.

asr-005577
05:27:15.250 --> 05:27:17.150
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Kasi two more years na lang po kami.

asr-005578
05:27:17.890 --> 05:27:24.370
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: So, ah, para ma-increase naman namin yung aming infrastructure support in terms of post-harvest, ah, facility po, sir.

asr-005579
05:27:24.710 --> 05:27:30.350
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: And, ah, the other one, sir, is that, ah, we would like your support for our fertilizer, no?

asr-005580
05:27:30.830 --> 05:27:34.070
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: Kasi sa ngayon kasi, sir, ah, nag-import tayo ng ating fertilizer.

asr-005581
05:27:34.390 --> 05:27:41.790
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: And, ah, kailangan namin yung proposal namin ng fertilizer na at least, pero malaki-laki pang kailangan natin dito, ah.

asr-005582
05:27:41.790 --> 05:27:42.270
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: No?

asr-005583
05:27:43.770 --> 05:27:44.790
DA Undersecretary Roger V. Navarro: So, ah.

asr-005584
05:27:45.250 --> 05:27:49.450
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So much because we are all recorded so that we can be able to increase them.

asr-005585
05:27:50.090 --> 05:27:59.030
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Ang budget kasi sa 8.7, dapat, ah, nandun kami sa mga 30 billion po, sir, sa, ah, fertilizer po.

asr-005586
05:27:59.590 --> 05:28:00.150
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Well noted.

asr-005587
05:28:00.570 --> 05:28:03.310
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yusek Ching Caballero, what is your request?

asr-005588
05:28:04.050 --> 05:28:11.530
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Thank you, Mr. Chair, and, ah, with, ah, due respect to all the members of the, ah, committee and to our secretary,

asr-005589
05:28:11.530 --> 05:28:15.070
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: um, I just wanted to state, Mr. Chair, that the high-value crops,

asr-005590
05:28:15.250 --> 05:28:18.590
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: development program is one of the priority programs of the DA.

asr-005591
05:28:19.170 --> 05:28:26.810
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: It's intended to help address food security and in ensuring available, accessible, affordable, nutrient-dense food at all times.

asr-005592
05:28:27.310 --> 05:28:31.090
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: The high-value crops development program contributes to the following objectives.

asr-005593
05:28:31.710 --> 05:28:38.270
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Improve the overall performance of priority high-value crops industries by at least 2.5% yearly.

asr-005594
05:28:38.710 --> 05:28:44.030
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Increase farmers' income by at least 50% through diversification and value addition.

asr-005595
05:28:44.630 --> 05:28:45.090
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Increase low-income crops by at least 2.5% yearly.

asr-005596
05:28:45.090 --> 05:28:45.230
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Increase low-income crops by at least 2.5% yearly.

asr-005597
05:28:45.230 --> 05:28:49.950
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Increase local and global competitiveness of high-value crops by looking at premium products.

asr-005598
05:28:50.510 --> 05:28:56.950
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: And orchestrate localized operating mechanism to connect the transition from production to nutrition

asr-005599
05:28:56.950 --> 05:29:04.210
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: under the development of local economic enterprises and develop economically-sized production areas.

asr-005600
05:29:04.210 --> 05:29:14.610
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: With this, Mr. Chair, we humbly request, ah, this honorable body, ah, to, ah, allow us to have at least an 8 billion increase of the budget,

asr-005601
05:29:14.610 --> 05:29:17.870
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: which is, currently, we only have 1.7 billion.

asr-005602
05:29:18.490 --> 05:29:24.910
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: Um, this is based po doon sa mga realizations that post-harvest losses is extremely high.

asr-005603
05:29:25.410 --> 05:29:30.290
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: And, ah, the post-harvest losses does not only start at the production level.

asr-005604
05:29:30.630 --> 05:29:32.370
DA Undersecretary Cheryl Marie Natividad-Caballero: It goes down to the distribution.

