Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005910
05:44:41.490 --> 05:44:41.970
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Thank you.

asr-005911
05:44:42.070 --> 05:44:46.230
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: After the explosive interpellation of my seatmate here,

asr-005912
05:44:46.350 --> 05:44:47.770
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: a good friend of my father,

asr-005913
05:44:48.330 --> 05:44:49.390
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Congressman Rufus,

asr-005914
05:44:50.390 --> 05:44:52.610
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: a good friend of Congressman Edsel Lagman,

asr-005915
05:44:52.610 --> 05:44:58.270
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: let me congratulate the speedy responses

asr-005916
05:44:58.270 --> 05:44:58.610
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: from the...

asr-005917
05:44:59.200 --> 05:45:00.500
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: DA team.

asr-005918
05:45:01.320 --> 05:45:09.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Secretary Kiko, I would like to thank you for including the high-value crops farmers

asr-005919
05:45:09.280 --> 05:45:10.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: in the PAF.

asr-005920
05:45:10.280 --> 05:45:17.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: I was told by our regional director, Director Tornilla, that we have enough funds to cover

asr-005921
05:45:17.340 --> 05:45:26.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: not only the farmers for the three crops initially, rice, sugar, and corn, and the fisher folks,

asr-005922
05:45:26.280 --> 05:45:31.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: but we also have for our high-value crops farmers.

asr-005923
05:45:31.040 --> 05:45:33.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So mabalus po na da kula.

asr-005924
05:45:33.040 --> 05:45:37.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasama po ba dito ang coconut farmers?

asr-005925
05:45:37.040 --> 05:45:42.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Unfortunately, Mr. Chair, hindi kasama ang coconut farmers.

asr-005926
05:45:42.040 --> 05:45:44.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Hindi kasama ang coconut.

asr-005927
05:45:44.040 --> 05:45:46.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ang abaca farmers?

asr-005928
05:45:46.040 --> 05:45:48.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Pwedeng isama, Mr. Chair.

asr-005929
05:45:48.040 --> 05:45:49.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasama rin.

asr-005930
05:45:49.040 --> 05:45:50.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Okay.

asr-005931
05:45:50.040 --> 05:45:55.120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So maraming salamat po doon kasi yun po yun na pansin namin doon sa PAF na nilimit lang

asr-005932
05:45:55.120 --> 05:45:56.120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: siya sa tatlo.

asr-005933
05:45:56.120 --> 05:45:58.880
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sa tatlong major commodities.

asr-005934
05:45:58.880 --> 05:46:05.880
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Mr. Chairman, may I ask from the National Dairy Authority and the Philippine Carabao

asr-005935
05:46:05.880 --> 05:46:12.880
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Center regarding our milk production, local milk production, may I ask them to join us

asr-005936
05:46:12.880 --> 05:46:19.900
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: here?

asr-005937
05:46:19.900 --> 05:46:27.900
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: The NDA plays a crucial and much appreciated role in the implementation of the Masustansyang

asr-005938
05:46:27.900 --> 05:46:30.900
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Pagkain para sa Batang Pilipino Act.

asr-005939
05:46:30.900 --> 05:46:34.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: As one of the lead agencies of the milk feeding program.

asr-005940
05:46:34.660 --> 05:46:41.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: However, I would like to know, get the information from your agency, how much is really being

asr-005941
05:46:41.660 --> 05:46:44.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: produced by our local dairy farmers?

asr-005942
05:46:44.660 --> 05:46:57.660
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Mr. Chair, as of 2025, as of 2024, excuse me, the milk production was just 29 million liters.

asr-005943
05:46:57.660 --> 05:47:05.780
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: But as the PSA data shows, as of 2025, we increased it to 43 million, 43 million liters.

asr-005944
05:47:05.780 --> 05:47:10.700
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: But still, we agree on the observation that it's still not enough for the entire milk

asr-005945
05:47:10.700 --> 05:47:11.700
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: feeding program.

asr-005946
05:47:11.700 --> 05:47:16.420
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: That's why we resort to sterilized milk, milk production.

asr-005947
05:47:16.420 --> 05:47:18.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Okay.

asr-005948
05:47:18.580 --> 05:47:24.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: I see from your report that you have exceeded your targets for 2026.

asr-005949
05:47:24.660 --> 05:47:25.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: In fact, you have produced 21% of your milk.

asr-005950
05:47:25.660 --> 05:47:26.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Okay.

asr-005951
05:47:26.660 --> 05:47:27.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Thank you.

asr-005952
05:47:27.660 --> 05:47:32.060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And you have produced 21% more than what you have produced for the same period between

asr-005953
05:47:32.060 --> 05:47:38.240
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: January to June of 2025 at 25.38 million liters.

asr-005954
05:47:38.240 --> 05:47:43.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And yet, this is just, what, 90%?

asr-005955
05:47:43.340 --> 05:47:45.940
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: 90% is still imported?

asr-005956
05:47:45.940 --> 05:47:49.900
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: How much is still the percentage of imported dairy?

asr-005957
05:47:49.900 --> 05:47:56.280
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Madam, Mr. Chair, as of today, as of 2025, we have also increased the milk sufficiency

asr-005958
05:47:56.280 --> 05:47:57.660
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: of the country.

asr-005959
05:47:57.660 --> 05:48:01.020
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: From 1% for the longest year to 2.2%.

asr-005960
05:48:01.020 --> 05:48:02.020
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: You're right.

asr-005961
05:48:02.020 --> 05:48:07.780
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Still, the imported dairy is, in the average, 98%.

asr-005962
05:48:07.780 --> 05:48:17.100
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: During the hearing with the Department of Finance, as we were discussing the proposed

asr-005963
05:48:17.100 --> 05:48:26.180
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: progress bill of the President, it was admitted by the Department of Finance that we, that

asr-005964
05:48:26.180 --> 05:48:27.140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: they are recommending...

asr-005965
05:48:27.140 --> 05:48:35.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: We are recommending that fermented and flavored milks remain as exempted to the sweetened beverage

asr-005966
05:48:35.280 --> 05:48:36.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: tax.

asr-005967
05:48:36.280 --> 05:48:42.380
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And it is because that is what is being used in the feeding program of our school-based

asr-005968
05:48:42.380 --> 05:48:43.380
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: children.

asr-005969
05:48:43.380 --> 05:48:50.500
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And our target for school-based children is, how much is our target?

asr-005970
05:48:50.500 --> 05:48:51.500
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: 4.5 million?

asr-005971
05:48:51.500 --> 05:48:52.500
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yes.

asr-005972
05:48:52.500 --> 05:48:55.500
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Mr. Chair, for 2026, it's 4.5 million.

asr-005973
05:48:55.500 --> 05:48:56.500
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: 4.5 million.

asr-005974
05:48:56.500 --> 05:48:57.500
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And you have a 3 billion budget for this?

asr-005975
05:48:57.500 --> 05:49:06.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: I mean, the DSWD and the DepEd has allocated for their fresh milk feeding program around

asr-005976
05:49:06.340 --> 05:49:07.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: 3 billion.

asr-005977
05:49:07.340 --> 05:49:10.460
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yes, for NDA, it's about 3 billion.

asr-005978
05:49:10.460 --> 05:49:13.820
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: It is just for DepEd's milk feeding program.

asr-005979
05:49:13.820 --> 05:49:17.240
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Not included the DSWD milk feeding program.

asr-005980
05:49:17.240 --> 05:49:18.240
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Oh, okay.

asr-005981
05:49:18.240 --> 05:49:19.240
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So, it's still higher.

asr-005982
05:49:19.240 --> 05:49:20.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And it was you who said that that's the best incentive for our farmers.

asr-005983
05:49:20.640 --> 05:49:21.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: That's right.

asr-005984
05:49:21.640 --> 05:49:22.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: To go into the field?

asr-005985
05:49:22.640 --> 05:49:23.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes.

asr-005986
05:49:23.640 --> 05:49:24.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: That's the best incentive for our farmers.

asr-005987
05:49:24.640 --> 05:49:25.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: That's right.

asr-005988
05:49:25.640 --> 05:49:26.380
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: That's right.

asr-005989
05:49:26.380 --> 05:49:26.480
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes.

asr-005990
05:49:26.500 --> 05:49:33.420
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: dairy. Because if there's a demand, because we have a law, there's a demand for fresh milk.

asr-005991
05:49:33.760 --> 05:49:41.260
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And let me just emphasize that what we are feeding our children now, these fermented milk

asr-005992
05:49:41.260 --> 05:49:50.220
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: and flavored milk beverages, a single serving provides around 9 to 21 grams of sugar. That's

asr-005993
05:49:50.220 --> 05:50:00.060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: around 2.2 to 5 teaspoons of sugar per serving. So instead of helping our kids be more healthy,

asr-005994
05:50:00.220 --> 05:50:08.160
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: be healthier, we are giving them this craving for sugar at a very young age. So kailangan po talaga

asr-005995
05:50:08.160 --> 05:50:15.880
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: i-fast track natin ang ating programa sa dairy production, local dairy production. So can you

asr-005996
05:50:15.880 --> 05:50:20.200
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: tell us, kanina si Congressman Rufus asked you,

asr-005997
05:50:20.220 --> 05:50:26.200
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: for cattle, but I want to see the total picture, ano ang ginagawa ngayon ng National Dairy

asr-005998
05:50:26.200 --> 05:50:35.160
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: and the Carabao Center for us to at least move forward so that we can produce our own milk

asr-005999
05:50:35.160 --> 05:50:40.840
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: for our children? Tama po, Mr. Chair. One of the reasons po bakit hindi dumadami ang ating

asr-006000
05:50:40.840 --> 05:50:45.880
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: milk production is napakakonti po ng ating mga alagang gatasang hayop. Dahil po sa mahabang

asr-006001
05:50:45.880 --> 05:50:50.200
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: panahon, ang ating mga iniimport ng mga alagang gatasang hayop,

asr-006002
05:50:50.220 --> 05:50:55.540
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: duretsong binibigay po sa farmers. At more often than not, ang mangyayari po dyan ay mamamatay.

asr-006003
05:50:55.640 --> 05:51:02.360
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: But for this year, nakapagtayo po tayo ng mga stock farms. Stock farms na kung saan natin po ilalagay

asr-006004
05:51:02.360 --> 05:51:07.460
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: ang mga imported animals para sila ma-acclimatize muna. Doon po muna sila magpaparami at pagka

asr-006005
05:51:07.460 --> 05:51:12.420
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: dumami na po sila, meron na po tayong source ng mga island-born dairy cattle na mas madali

asr-006006
05:51:12.420 --> 05:51:16.760
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: pong alagaan ng mga dairy farmers. Yan pong ginagawa po natin. Kaya yung mga dadating po natin

asr-006007
05:51:16.760 --> 05:51:20.200
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: mga imported dairy animals this October, hindi po natin magpaparami ng mga imported dairy animals.

asr-006008
05:51:20.200 --> 05:51:26.900
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yan diretsong ipamimigay muna. Dahil malamang sa malamang, mamamatay po yan. Ilalagay po na

asr-006009
05:51:26.900 --> 05:51:32.560
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: natin sa stock farms yan para maklimatay sila, dumami sila, at doon natin kukunin yung ating

asr-006010
05:51:32.560 --> 05:51:35.200
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: ipamamahagi kasi island-born na po sila.

asr-006011
05:51:36.380 --> 05:51:44.280
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Aside from yung ating cattle, kailangan rin nila ng particular grass, di ba? Kasama rin po ba yan sa programa ninyo?

asr-006012
05:51:44.280 --> 05:51:50.160
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Tama po yan, Mr. Chair. Dahil po, kasama po sa binigay na budget po sa ating

asr-006013
05:51:50.160 --> 05:51:56.660
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: NDA ay yung pagpapagawa ng mga feed centers. Ito po mga feed centers ang tutugon sa pangangailangan po ng ating mga

asr-006014
05:51:56.660 --> 05:52:02.580
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: dairy farmers pagdating po sa pakain. Dahil alam naman po natin, ang prinsipyo sa dairy, garbage in, garbage out.

asr-006015
05:52:03.000 --> 05:52:04.980
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Pakainin mo ng basura yan, basura ang gatas niyan.

asr-006016
05:52:06.140 --> 05:52:09.660
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sinabi ninyong feeds, ano yun, magtatanim sila ng grass?

asr-006017
05:52:10.080 --> 05:52:17.880
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yes, not just grass po, including corn. Depende po sa lugar. May mga lugar po talaga na maganda magtanim ng mga corn.

asr-006018
05:52:17.880 --> 05:52:20.140
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: May mga lugar naman po na maganda magtanim ng mga corn.

asr-006019
05:52:20.160 --> 05:52:25.720
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Magtanim ng grass, katulad po ng napier. At yung mga harvest po yan, dadalim po yan sa mga feed centers natin,

asr-006020
05:52:26.440 --> 05:52:31.140
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: kung saan yan ipoprocess para maging silage po, at upang ipamahagi po sa ating mga dairy farmers.

asr-006021
05:52:31.660 --> 05:52:37.160
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sa presenting budget po ninyo, ano po ang na-anticipate ninyong increase sa local milk production?

asr-006022
05:52:37.620 --> 05:52:44.060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And with the additional incentive for our farmers, kasi may ready market, may strong demand,

asr-006023
05:52:44.060 --> 05:52:50.140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: ang mga school feeding program, ano po ang nakikita ninyong targets for the next?

asr-006024
05:52:50.160 --> 05:53:01.580
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Mr. Chair, actually, pagdating po sa milk feeding program, wala na po kami talaga ang maireklamo dahil napakagandang budget ang naibigay po sa National Dairy Authority para sa milk feeding program.

asr-006025
05:53:02.060 --> 05:53:08.780
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Noong mga nakaraang panahon po kasi, ang problema ng ating mga magagatas, tumutulo po ang gatas, walang bumibili, literally tinatapon.

asr-006026
05:53:09.380 --> 05:53:14.980
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: But because of this milk feeding program, naingganyo po sila na alagaan ng hayop nila magpagatas.

asr-006027
05:53:14.980 --> 05:53:19.860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: And that's one of the reasons why nag-increase ang milk production, dahil pinagahanda nila ang milk feeding program.

asr-006028
05:53:20.160 --> 05:53:24.800
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Now, pagdating naman po sa budget ng NDA, may iiyak po kayo sa neb na naibigay sa amin.

asr-006029
05:53:26.320 --> 05:53:30.300
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Nasa P216 lang po. Taman-tama lang po yung pang-sweldo. Actually, kulang pa po.

asr-006030
05:53:31.000 --> 05:53:36.740
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Kaya po, napakasakitignan na ang mga kawani po ng NDA, sumusweldo pero walang gagawin.

asr-006031
05:53:37.940 --> 05:53:45.420
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yung P3 billion na budget para sa milk feeding program ay direct ang mapupunta sa mga farmers at sa mga cooperatives, hindi po ba?

asr-006032
05:53:45.760 --> 05:53:46.020
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes, po.

asr-006033
05:53:46.020 --> 05:53:47.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At hindi naman talaga sa NDA.

asr-006034
05:53:48.140 --> 05:53:50.140
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yan po yung pera po ng debit for milk feeding program.

asr-006035
05:53:50.160 --> 05:53:56.860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yung pera po ng debit for milk feeding program ay binigay po sa NDA at sa PCC upang ipamili namin ng gatas sa ating mga dairy farmers gamit ang sagipsaka.

asr-006036
05:53:57.760 --> 05:54:05.860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Kaya mas madali po natin may bibigay ang ating servisyo o ating mabibiling gatas sa mga farmers dahil diretsyo po natin ipoprofure sa kanila yan.

asr-006037
05:54:05.980 --> 05:54:07.660
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Hindi na po sila magpapatayan sa presyo.

asr-006038
05:54:09.440 --> 05:54:12.720
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Okay, so tingnan mo yung sitwasyon ng NDA.

asr-006039
05:54:13.000 --> 05:54:17.000
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Huwag mo masyadong, talagang kulang na kulang talaga sila sa pod.

asr-006040
05:54:17.000 --> 05:54:20.140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yan, yan ang maganda, Chris Van Rufus.

asr-006041
05:54:20.160 --> 05:54:21.820
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Is my time over?

asr-006042
05:54:22.260 --> 05:54:22.640
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Not yet.

asr-006043
05:54:22.720 --> 05:54:23.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Not yet, okay.

asr-006044
05:54:24.180 --> 05:54:25.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Salamat po, attorney.

asr-006045
05:54:25.820 --> 05:54:26.640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Thank you so much.

asr-006046
05:54:26.640 --> 05:54:26.820
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Maraming salamat po, sir.

asr-006047
05:54:27.260 --> 05:54:33.040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Baka kausapin ko na lang po kayo in private yung National, yung Carabao Center.

asr-006048
05:54:33.620 --> 05:54:39.400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: May mahalaga lang po akong gustong itanong sa Sugar Regulatory Administration.

asr-006049
05:54:41.480 --> 05:54:42.080
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Hello.

asr-006050
05:54:43.620 --> 05:54:44.860
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Good afternoon, sir.

asr-006051
05:54:47.300 --> 05:54:49.860
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ngayon, pinag-uusapan natin ang impact ng training.

asr-006052
05:54:50.160 --> 05:54:53.400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sa sweetened beverages.

asr-006053
05:54:55.020 --> 05:55:01.980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Nag-impose tayo ng 2018 ng 6 pesos sa refined sugar na ba ito?

asr-006054
05:55:02.540 --> 05:55:02.980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sugar.

asr-006055
05:55:03.000 --> 05:55:03.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Raw sugar.

asr-006056
05:55:03.720 --> 05:55:04.260
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Raw sugar.

asr-006057
05:55:05.200 --> 05:55:08.980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And sa fructose naman ay mas mataas.

asr-006058
05:55:09.480 --> 05:55:12.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And palagay ko mas gamay po ninyo yan, sir.

asr-006059
05:55:13.480 --> 05:55:15.840
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Gusto namin makuha sana ang trend.

asr-006060
05:55:15.840 --> 05:55:19.060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Since 2017 up to the present.

asr-006061
05:55:19.500 --> 05:55:20.140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yung volume.

asr-006062
05:55:20.160 --> 05:55:24.760
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Volume of sugar consumed and bought by type of industry.

asr-006063
05:55:25.260 --> 05:55:29.420
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Hindi lang limited sa mga sugar beverages na industry.

asr-006064
05:55:30.940 --> 05:55:35.600
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And isabay na po rin ninyo yung demand for artificial sweetener.

asr-006065
05:55:36.160 --> 05:55:40.340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasi I think next week, napag-uusapan po sa Ways and Means Committee,

asr-006066
05:55:40.940 --> 05:55:48.400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: yung proposal ng Department of Finance na dagdagan ang buwis para sa sweetened beverages.

asr-006067
05:55:48.400 --> 05:55:48.760
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes.

asr-006068
05:55:50.160 --> 05:55:57.580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And kailangan po natin makita rin ang impact nitong buwis na ito kung meron man sa ating local sugar farmers.

asr-006069
05:55:58.020 --> 05:56:05.440
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasi naandito si Congresswoman Subiri, I'm quite sure, interesado siya malaman kung anong impact nito sa local farmers natin.

asr-006070
05:56:05.980 --> 05:56:14.120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So, kailangan po namin yung data na kung maaari maibigay po sa amin para magkaroon tayo ng trajectory ng sugar trading.

asr-006071
05:56:14.120 --> 05:56:20.120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And then anong magiging impact ng dagdag buwis kung meron man sa ating local farmers.

asr-006072
05:56:20.160 --> 05:56:24.160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes, po, Mr. Chair, we will provide your office with the data.

asr-006073
05:56:24.160 --> 05:56:28.160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay, thank you, Honorable Lagman.

asr-006074
05:56:28.160 --> 05:56:35.160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Next, the Chair recognizes Apu Romeo Momos Senor.

asr-006075
05:56:35.160 --> 05:56:39.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary.

asr-006076
05:56:39.160 --> 05:56:42.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I will go direct to my parroquial concern, Mr. Secretary.

asr-006077
05:56:42.160 --> 05:56:46.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I have three questions, one for Philpida, one for BFAR, and one for NIA.

asr-006078
05:56:46.160 --> 05:56:49.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary,

asr-006079
05:56:49.160 --> 05:56:57.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Surigao del Sur, particularly the Municipality of Marihatag, is considered one of the major producers of high-quality abaca fiber.

asr-006080
05:56:57.160 --> 05:57:07.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, ranked number four among the abaca-producing provinces, producing 4,140 metric tons of abaca fiber in 2025,

asr-006081
05:57:07.160 --> 05:57:18.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: about 7.4% of our national production, and the only abaca-producing province which posted a positive 10% growth rate,

asr-006082
05:57:18.160 --> 05:57:25.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: while the rest of the provinces producing abaca are all in negative growth rate.

asr-006083
05:57:25.160 --> 05:57:36.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Right now, a road network connecting the production site to the main national highway and market centers are about to be started,

asr-006084
05:57:36.160 --> 05:57:42.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: funded by the PRDP program, the program of the World Bank.

asr-006085
05:57:42.160 --> 05:57:46.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And Municipality of Marihatag, kahit na maliit ho siya, six plus munis,

asr-006086
05:57:46.160 --> 05:57:55.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: six plus municipality was able to post or to share 30% as a counterpart, which is 30 million po.

asr-006087
05:57:55.160 --> 05:58:00.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The area being developed is an IP community po, Manubo tribe ho ang nandyan,

asr-006088
05:58:00.160 --> 05:58:05.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and just recently been declared insurgent-free.

asr-006089
05:58:05.160 --> 05:58:15.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil yung lugar na yun ho dati ay hindi mapuntahan ng tao dahil talagang insurgent area, rebel infested yun.

asr-006090
05:58:16.160 --> 05:58:20.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, most of the farmers are rebel returnees.

asr-006091
05:58:20.160 --> 05:58:24.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In order to help the Manubo tribe and the rebel returnees,

asr-006092
05:58:24.160 --> 05:58:32.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: thus the establishment of Abaca Agro-Industrial Corridor in the Municipality of Marihatag, Surigao del Sur,

asr-006093
05:58:32.160 --> 05:58:41.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: which was endorsed by RDC as one of the top 30 implementation-ready priority projects in Caraga.

asr-006094
05:58:41.160 --> 05:58:44.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kompleto na ho ng papili sito. May feasibility study ang lahat-lahat.

asr-006095
05:58:44.160 --> 05:58:45.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kompleto na ho ng papili sito. May feasibility study ang lahat-lahat.

asr-006096
05:58:46.160 --> 05:58:51.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The total project cost is 739 million.

asr-006097
05:58:51.160 --> 05:58:58.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But this year ang hiningi lang nila is 47 million lang po para to start with.

asr-006098
05:58:58.160 --> 05:59:05.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually ang 47 million is for the establishment of Abaca Consolidation and Processing Center, if I am right.

asr-006099
05:59:05.160 --> 05:59:11.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So para lang ho tayo maka-start, para ho mayroon ng bahay kung sa ibig sabihin pa.

asr-006100
05:59:11.160 --> 05:59:14.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Para tuloy-tuloy na ho ang ating programa.

asr-006101
05:59:14.160 --> 05:59:25.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Secretary, wala ng ibang provinces ang may ganun potential in Abaca except Surigao del Sur.

asr-006102
05:59:25.160 --> 05:59:27.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya nga ho kailangan siguro nating matulungan.

asr-006103
05:59:27.160 --> 05:59:35.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: My question is ang 47 million ba ay naisama natin sa ating budget this year, 2027?

asr-006104
05:59:35.160 --> 05:59:42.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, ang sagot diyan is yes. Kaya lang nasa tier 2, Mr. Chair.

asr-006105
05:59:42.160 --> 05:59:52.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: When you mean tier 2, Secretary, is it not part of your budget, part of the GAO or your NEP right now?

asr-006106
05:59:52.160 --> 06:00:00.240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Because there are tier 1 and tier 2s. I would suppose that's part of...

asr-006107
06:00:01.390 --> 06:00:07.270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, ang problem daw, sabi namin USIC for Finance, hindi na-approve yung Tier 2 namin.

asr-006108
06:00:11.100 --> 06:00:16.100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: How do we go about it, Mr. Secretary? I think this is one of the best programs TILFIDA ever had.

asr-006109
06:00:16.260 --> 06:00:22.280
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sige, sir. Meron kaming option. Kailangan lang talaga natin kalagyan ng bahay. May bahay na ba yan?

asr-006110
06:00:23.920 --> 06:00:28.960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kailangan lang namin lagyan ng bahay. Meron kaming World Bank na pwedeng i-access, Mr. Chair.

asr-006111
06:00:28.960 --> 06:00:37.020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, the 47 million is just for i-bahay so that the next budget, it will be Tier 1 na. Sana eh.

asr-006112
06:00:38.780 --> 06:00:50.780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sige, well, Mr. Chair, we will endeavor na mailagay natin. Tulungan natin, Mr. Chair, na malagay sa budget past Tier 1 kahit lagyan lang ng 5-10 million, then kami nang bahala magdagdag.

asr-006113
06:00:50.780 --> 06:00:58.360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, po. In our side, we'll do also our part. My next question is addressed to BIFAR.

asr-006114
06:01:00.300 --> 06:01:09.000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of the 13 municipalities and one city in my district, 1st District of Surigao del Sur, 13 of these municipalities are situated along the coast.

asr-006115
06:01:10.120 --> 06:01:16.960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, 40% of our inhabitants, people in Surigao del Sur, are fishermen, Mr. Secretary.

asr-006116
06:01:17.960 --> 06:01:28.960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Our produce, the production, whatever derived or caught from fishing, are supplied.

asr-006117
06:01:28.960 --> 06:01:36.680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Supplied to our neighboring municipalities, provinces, and cities. At dahil dito po, kami ang nagsusupply.

asr-006118
06:01:38.120 --> 06:01:51.840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Right now, ito lang ho ang problema. Right now, although we are producing enough fish for reconsumption of our neighboring provinces and cities, wala ho kaming cold storage po.

asr-006119
06:01:51.840 --> 06:01:58.120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya yung aming mga fishermen ay mapilitan i-binta ng mura kung panahon na maraming kuha.

asr-006120
06:01:58.960 --> 06:02:12.500
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So sana po, I have been, in fact, a resolution has already submitted, a resolution from the Municipality of Liangga, where the proposed cold storage will be established.

asr-006121
06:02:13.080 --> 06:02:17.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: E nandito na ho, nasabit na last year pa po. Sana mabigyan ng priority po ito.

asr-006122
06:02:18.080 --> 06:02:21.300
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair. Saan exactong lugar, Mr. Chair?

asr-006123
06:02:21.300 --> 06:02:27.540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, Mr. Secretary, Barangay St. Christine, Liangga, Surigao del Sur.

asr-006124
06:02:28.240 --> 06:02:28.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes.

asr-006125
06:02:28.960 --> 06:02:32.150
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes. Liangga po.

asr-006126
06:02:34.510 --> 06:02:39.470
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, sir. Ang lagayin ho na ito, Mr. Chair, is ice plant and cold storage.

asr-006127
06:02:39.990 --> 06:02:41.410
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you very much, Mr. Secretary.

asr-006128
06:02:41.410 --> 06:02:53.850
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And the last, Mr. Chairman. In my district, this is addressed to NIA. In my district, I have two NIS, National Irrigation System.

asr-006129
06:02:54.890 --> 06:03:01.510
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And that suggests that we have thousands of irrigated farmlands.

asr-006130
06:03:02.070 --> 06:03:05.190
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Producing so much number of rice.

asr-006131
06:03:06.230 --> 06:03:13.650
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kami ho ang nagsusupply ng mga, ng palay sa Gawaw, sa Cagayan de Uro, sa Marawi City.

asr-006132
06:03:13.790 --> 06:03:15.250
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Because of the two NIS.

asr-006133
06:03:15.970 --> 06:03:22.010
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: My only problem now is, bakit ho dalawang NIS, 5 million lang ho ang allocation?

asr-006134
06:03:23.390 --> 06:03:32.050
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil sa 5 million lang ang allocation, I would, parang nakikita ko ho na ang mga repair, maintenance, as well as upkeep.

asr-006135
06:03:32.070 --> 06:03:35.150
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of the NIS is never enough.

asr-006136
06:03:35.830 --> 06:03:37.390
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, not enough, no?

asr-006137
06:03:37.830 --> 06:03:44.130
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, it will, of course, reduce the production of rice per hectare.

asr-006138
06:03:44.250 --> 06:03:49.310
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung hindi natin masusupplyan ng sufficient number of water, volume of water required.

asr-006139
06:03:50.210 --> 06:03:56.250
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya nga ho, kailangan ho sana natin madagdagan ang ating requirements.

asr-006140
06:03:57.070 --> 06:03:58.470
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dalawang NIS po, ha?

asr-006141
06:03:58.470 --> 06:04:02.060
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-006142
06:04:03.320 --> 06:04:07.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Siguro nakita ni Honorable Congressman ito.

asr-006143
06:04:08.200 --> 06:04:10.400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang proposal namin sa isa, 2 billion eh.

asr-006144
06:04:10.620 --> 06:04:13.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Talagang 2 billion pa ang proposal namin.

asr-006145
06:04:13.900 --> 06:04:18.380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang pet project po namin doon na isa is yung Tago Riz.

asr-006146
06:04:18.600 --> 06:04:25.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nag-propose po kami doon nga ng, at saka yung repair ng Santa Filomena CIS, 250 million.

asr-006147
06:04:26.780 --> 06:04:29.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero tama po kayo, dalawang 5 million lang ang lumabas, sir.

asr-006148
06:04:29.720 --> 06:04:33.260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But again, isa po.

asr-006149
06:04:33.320 --> 06:04:34.540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito kasi sa priority natin.

asr-006150
06:04:34.860 --> 06:04:37.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: In fact, isa ito sa pinakamalaking hingin nga natin ang punto.

asr-006151
06:04:38.060 --> 06:04:40.460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung meron po tayong additional, sir, babalikan po namin ito.

asr-006152
06:04:40.480 --> 06:04:46.900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Administrator, I have been here in Congress and I've been a vice chairman of the Committee on Appropriation for 8 years now.

asr-006153
06:04:47.500 --> 06:04:52.380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And never in any instance I heard an agency na sobrang kanilang allocation.

asr-006154
06:04:52.600 --> 06:04:53.380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Laging kulang po.

asr-006155
06:04:54.080 --> 06:04:59.740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang question ko lang ho, how do you allocate that meager budget you have?

asr-006156
06:05:00.240 --> 06:05:02.560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kasi po, kailangan equitable ang distribution.

asr-006157
06:05:02.720 --> 06:05:03.120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Not equal.

asr-006158
06:05:03.120 --> 06:05:03.780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But equitable.

asr-006159
06:05:04.580 --> 06:05:07.800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mindanao po is i-breadbasket natin, di ba?

asr-006160
06:05:08.520 --> 06:05:12.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dapat ho, may problema si Ropos, kulang.

asr-006161
06:05:12.980 --> 06:05:15.320
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Si Amatod, Congressman Amatong, kulang din.

asr-006162
06:05:15.440 --> 06:05:17.700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Lahat-lahat kami yata, kulang buong Mindanao po.

asr-006163
06:05:18.700 --> 06:05:22.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang irony is, we are the ones supplying ng pagkain dito sa Metro Manila.

asr-006164
06:05:23.580 --> 06:05:31.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And why not put some bigger share even in the allocation of budget for irrigation?

asr-006165
06:05:31.600 --> 06:05:32.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

asr-006166
06:05:32.460 --> 06:05:32.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually po.

asr-006167
06:05:33.120 --> 06:05:33.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang NIA kasi.

asr-006168
06:05:33.980 --> 06:05:39.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Again, ulitin ko po, Mr. Chair, ang na-priority po talaga na bigyan namin ng pondo are the ongoing projects.

asr-006169
06:05:39.820 --> 06:05:45.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But kung mapapansin, bibigyan po ko po kaya ng listahan, Mr. Chair.

asr-006170
06:05:45.580 --> 06:05:49.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kapag kami mga savings po ang NIA, lagi namin nilalagay po lahat sa Mindanao.

asr-006171
06:05:49.980 --> 06:05:54.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: I will give you po a list, yung modification po namin this year, Mr. Chair.

asr-006172
06:05:54.680 --> 06:05:58.700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Makikita nyo po na pupunta halos lahat sa Mindanao yung aming budget.

asr-006173
06:05:58.700 --> 06:06:00.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And lastly, Mr. Chairman.

asr-006174
06:06:00.740 --> 06:06:03.100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Lastly, sinabi ni Presidente nung panahon,

asr-006175
06:06:03.120 --> 06:06:08.800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: sa Suna, na ang tataposin nila, in fact, that is also the directive to the Department of Public Works and Highways,

asr-006176
06:06:09.140 --> 06:06:12.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: tataposin nila yung mga ongoing projects.

asr-006177
06:06:13.040 --> 06:06:19.420
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In my district po, 60 milyon na lang ang kulang ng Santa Pilumina Dam.

asr-006178
06:06:20.540 --> 06:06:21.900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Sana papangsyon na siya.

asr-006179
06:06:22.660 --> 06:06:23.960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Sana po ang lagyan natin yan.

asr-006180
06:06:24.400 --> 06:06:25.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kasi that's the priority of the President.

asr-006181
06:06:26.760 --> 06:06:29.400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung tapusin yung mga proyekto ng nabimbin po.

asr-006182
06:06:30.640 --> 06:06:31.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-006183
06:06:31.660 --> 06:06:32.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Iipa-priority natin po yan.

asr-006184
06:06:33.120 --> 06:06:35.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Administrator.

asr-006185
06:06:35.640 --> 06:06:36.120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-006186
06:06:36.980 --> 06:06:38.240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-006187
06:06:39.380 --> 06:06:43.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Thank you, Apo, Rep. Momo.

asr-006188
06:06:44.420 --> 06:06:50.620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: The Chair recognizes Rep. Reynald Michael Tan.

asr-006189
06:06:56.540 --> 06:06:57.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Si Apo.

asr-006190
06:07:01.000 --> 06:07:01.440
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Sorry.

asr-006191
06:07:01.440 --> 06:07:03.440
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-006192
06:07:04.320 --> 06:07:08.100
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And good afternoon, guys, Secretary.

asr-006193
06:07:08.500 --> 06:07:09.680
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And the rest of the administration.

asr-006194
06:07:09.680 --> 06:07:10.240
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And the FDA family.

asr-006195
06:07:10.780 --> 06:07:16.440
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Anyway, Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chair, I have some few questions lang.

asr-006196
06:07:17.340 --> 06:07:24.060
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Pertaining to the FMR of the 2025, which we considered as FLR,

asr-006197
06:07:24.560 --> 06:07:31.420
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: what is the current status of the farm-to-market roads of the 2025 budget?

asr-006198
06:07:32.520 --> 06:07:38.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung sa 2025, Mr. Chair, yung sa 2025 na farm-to-market na 23 billion,

asr-006199
06:07:39.680 --> 06:07:42.740
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: na FLR doon is 10.7.

asr-006200
06:07:43.280 --> 06:07:49.280
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: From what I understand, yung 5.7, i-re-release soon.

asr-006201
06:07:49.940 --> 06:07:59.730
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, what is the reason na i-re-release yung 5 billion plus at saka yung the address na ay hindi ma-re-release?

asr-006202
06:08:00.270 --> 06:08:02.810
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I think it's more of the budget yan.

asr-006203
06:08:04.810 --> 06:08:09.110
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We always request, the DA always requests, Mr. Chair, na i-release lahat yan.

asr-006204
06:08:10.790 --> 06:08:11.310
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then,

asr-006205
06:08:11.470 --> 06:08:13.570
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: it depends sa cash flow, I guess.

asr-006206
06:08:13.690 --> 06:08:16.430
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kaya, yung 10.7, 5.7,

asr-006207
06:08:16.570 --> 06:08:20.450
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: mas buwang in-advise lang kami ng DBM na i-re-release nila for now.

asr-006208
06:08:21.130 --> 06:08:21.430
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, Chair.

asr-006209
06:08:22.470 --> 06:08:24.650
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you, Sir Chair.

asr-006210
06:08:24.810 --> 06:08:28.490
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And in connection with the farm-to-market,

asr-006211
06:08:28.830 --> 06:08:30.710
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: for the 2026 budget,

asr-006212
06:08:32.250 --> 06:08:34.830
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: mabuti din na andito din si Yusek Arig.

asr-006213
06:08:35.410 --> 06:08:38.210
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: He was in Saumar, I think last month.

asr-006214
06:08:38.510 --> 06:08:41.330
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, at least nakita talaga yung situation namin.

asr-006215
06:08:41.470 --> 06:08:46.130
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, Mr. Chair, I just wanted to raise that

asr-006216
06:08:46.130 --> 06:09:01.850
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: yung detalye po nung farm-to-market is, I think, 5 meters yung width at saka 2.2 mm or meters yung thickness.

asr-006217
06:09:03.130 --> 06:09:05.930
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: 200 mm yung thickness.

asr-006218
06:09:05.930 --> 06:09:10.710
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: But, however, kasi yung situation namin sa Saumar, Secretary,

asr-006219
06:09:11.470 --> 06:09:15.670
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: medyo wala pa kaming masyadong road

asr-006220
06:09:15.670 --> 06:09:18.470
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: papunta mismo pa lang sa barangay.

asr-006221
06:09:18.670 --> 06:09:22.710
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Like, yung na-observe ko in some other provinces,

asr-006222
06:09:22.970 --> 06:09:25.810
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: na talaga may road na sila access going to the barangay

asr-006223
06:09:25.810 --> 06:09:28.010
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: and papunta na talaga sila sa farm.

asr-006224
06:09:28.550 --> 06:09:31.630
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, sa amin, because alam mo naman yung sitwasyon natin,

asr-006225
06:09:31.750 --> 06:09:34.430
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: 951 barangays in the entire province.

asr-006226
06:09:34.430 --> 06:09:40.630
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, medyo may mga more or less pang 10% pa kami ng mga barangays na walang road.

asr-006227
06:09:40.730 --> 06:09:41.430
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, we...

asr-006228
06:09:41.470 --> 06:09:45.590
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Utilize the farm-to-market leading to the barangay pa lang.

asr-006229
06:09:46.430 --> 06:09:49.230
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, however, nagkakaroon dyan ang mga overlapping.

asr-006230
06:09:49.950 --> 06:09:52.090
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Minsan yung DPWH yung nag-fund.

asr-006231
06:09:52.810 --> 06:09:54.110
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Minsan naman yung farm-to-market.

asr-006232
06:09:54.770 --> 06:10:01.230
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Pero, with the guidelines ngayon na 5 meters yung width at saka 200 mm.

asr-006233
06:10:01.510 --> 06:10:04.530
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, parang it does not align with the DP.

asr-006234
06:10:04.810 --> 06:10:09.230
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Kasi sa DP is 6 meters yung width at saka mas thicker yung...

asr-006235
06:10:09.870 --> 06:10:11.230
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Like, 0.2...

asr-006236
06:10:11.470 --> 06:10:15.810
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: 23 meters yung thickness.

asr-006237
06:10:15.810 --> 06:10:21.170
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, is it possible ba na pwede ba natin ma-adjust yan?

asr-006238
06:10:22.090 --> 06:10:28.910
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: At least the same na lang yung sa DP at saka sa FMR.

asr-006239
06:10:29.090 --> 06:10:33.910
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Kasi parang medyo masagwa din tingnan na 6 tapos magpa-5.

asr-006240
06:10:34.090 --> 06:10:38.410
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Then, sa unahan na naman magsi-6 kung DP naman yung mag-continue.

asr-006241
06:10:38.550 --> 06:10:40.610
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, magkakaroon kami ng konting problema.

asr-006242
06:10:40.610 --> 06:10:40.810
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, parang...

asr-006243
06:10:40.810 --> 06:10:40.890
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, parang...

asr-006244
06:10:40.890 --> 06:10:40.950
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, parang...

asr-006245
06:10:40.950 --> 06:10:41.450
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, parang...

asr-006246
06:10:41.470 --> 06:10:44.890
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, sa physical na hitsura nung road.

asr-006247
06:10:45.010 --> 06:10:50.710
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And at the same time, pag na-open na yung road natin, medyo marami na rin yung mga vehicle na pumapasok.

asr-006248
06:10:50.790 --> 06:10:51.610
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Malalaki na vehicle.

asr-006249
06:10:51.830 --> 06:10:56.970
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, chances is, the more thick yung road natin, the better yung maglalast din siya.

asr-006250
06:10:57.670 --> 06:11:02.690
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And lastly, yun sa 20% na elevation.

asr-006251
06:11:04.290 --> 06:11:07.330
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Medyo hilly kasi yung probinsya natin.

asr-006252
06:11:07.430 --> 06:11:09.310
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: There are a lot of winds hilly.

asr-006253
06:11:09.690 --> 06:11:11.310
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, kailangan natin ng...

asr-006254
06:11:11.310 --> 06:11:14.170
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Kanal, kailangan natin ng slow protection, and so on and so forth.

asr-006255
06:11:14.290 --> 06:11:19.010
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, I don't think na kakayanin yung 20%.

asr-006256
06:11:19.010 --> 06:11:22.070
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Baka lumagpas kami ng konti, Secretary.

asr-006257
06:11:27.260 --> 06:11:28.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, definitely.

asr-006258
06:11:28.900 --> 06:11:32.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Well, binabago na nga namin yung classification instead of concreting.

asr-006259
06:11:33.080 --> 06:11:43.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ginagawa namin construction para mas may flexibility, lalo na doon sa mga terrain na medyo difficult or needs slow protection.

asr-006260
06:11:43.680 --> 06:11:45.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meanwhile, yung sa...

asr-006261
06:11:45.560 --> 06:11:56.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sinasabi natin na mga bagong road opening at baka kulang nga yung thickness doon sa mga bagong kali dahil dating hindi pa dinadaanan.

asr-006262
06:11:57.440 --> 06:12:08.780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron tayong option na using the same budget but using soil stabilizers muna for the first few years para nga makompact muna siya.

asr-006263
06:12:09.460 --> 06:12:12.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But then, that's cheaper per kilometer.

asr-006264
06:12:12.840 --> 06:12:13.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, pwedeng...

asr-006265
06:12:15.560 --> 06:12:23.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Option, yung 15 million na 1 kilometer, baka maging 4 kilometers yun with soil stabilizers or 2 kilometers at least or 2, 3, no?

asr-006266
06:12:24.020 --> 06:12:25.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Using the soil stabilizers.

asr-006267
06:12:26.440 --> 06:12:31.580
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, yun ang isang option na depende na sa inyo kung gusto nyong gamitin.

asr-006268
06:12:32.220 --> 06:12:36.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Lastly, yung whether 6 meters or 5 meters.

asr-006269
06:12:40.000 --> 06:12:44.620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Well, I agree with you na mas magandang pareho na lang kami ng DP, no?

asr-006270
06:12:44.720 --> 06:12:44.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But...

asr-006271
06:12:45.560 --> 06:12:47.500
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yun na nga.

asr-006272
06:12:47.960 --> 06:12:50.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I guess we'll just have to talk to DP and agree.

asr-006273
06:12:50.960 --> 06:13:01.340
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But of course, if we do the 60 meters by 230 meter thick, it means din, mas maikli din yung magagawa namin per year.

asr-006274
06:13:02.240 --> 06:13:03.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mas iigse.

asr-006275
06:13:03.560 --> 06:13:06.480
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, for our own purpose.

asr-006276
06:13:06.480 --> 06:13:11.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, it depends siguro kung ano yung magandang direction talaga.

asr-006277
06:13:15.050 --> 06:13:15.990
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, yun lang, Mr. Chair.

asr-006278
