asr-006743
06:31:41.100 --> 06:31:50.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At ang assessment namin na yan is, ito lang pong first quarter ng 2026. So nadadagdagan pa po.

asr-006744
06:31:50.540 --> 06:32:07.540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Now, ang gusto sana namin, ang proposal namin po sa Department of Energy is that sana itong mga pumps namin may connect po sa, para makapag-supply kami sa electric cooperatives.

asr-006745
06:32:08.440 --> 06:32:20.300
