asr-006746
06:32:20.540 --> 06:32:21.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Wala ng transmission charge.

asr-006747
06:32:21.740 --> 06:32:24.900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Wala ng transmission charge. Kaya, suwak na sakpo sana ito.

asr-006748
06:32:24.900 --> 06:32:39.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: By the way, sir, magkakaroon po kami ng pilot project po sa Ilocos Norte with the INEC. Pagka naging successful po yun, tinitingnan namin that would mean around minimum of 600 million po na income sa NIA.

asr-006749
06:32:39.700 --> 06:32:45.900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And we are offering it for only 4 pesos per kilowatt hour po. Mas mababa pa sa singil ng DOE.

asr-006750
