DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Malinaw sa amin, pag ang high-value crops ang involved, no issue. Dahil meron na kaming study na lumalabas na dun sa ibang high-value crops like sile, eggplant, and others.

asr-006756
06:33:40.180 --> 06:33:45.420
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Actually, mas maganda yung production with shaded area kasi nga in between.

asr-006757
06:33:46.220 --> 06:33:50.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Doon sa bigas naman, yun ang aming main issue as of the moment.

asr-006758
06:33:50.540 --> 06:33:55.640
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Hindi pa kami pumapayag totally na maglagay ng solar sa rice land.

asr-006759
06:33:55.640 --> 06:34:09.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But meron kaming mga research na gagawin very soon sa aming mga DA stations sa Bohol at sa isa pa sa Mindanao to study how this can work.

asr-006760
06:34:10.720 --> 06:34:18.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But kung wala pa yung conclusive study, as of the moment, ayaw namin kung flat land for rice or others.

asr-006761
